('6619e31f90b00-inqr-33932519266966077', '', 'Marcus Riganelli', '2024-04-13', '{\"company\":\"Fusion Machine\",\"name\":\"Marcus Riganelli\",\"phone\":\"2896872720\",\"email\":\"marcus@fusionmachine.ca\",\"address\":\"636 Welland Ave\",\"post_code\":\"L2M 5V6\",\"city\":\"St. Catharines\",\"state\":\"ON\",\"country\":\"Canada\"}', 'Hello, we have one Lang vise and subplate for our DMU50 and I want to look into buying more. Do you have a price list for the whole Lang lineup? Thanks!', 0.00, 0, NULL, '2024-04-13 08:42:55', '2024-04-13 08:42:55'),
