8-user-92625359878879540'),
('652adcb3c7e53-prod-35019365300529712', 'Quick•Point® 52/96, Combo Grid Plate', '45748-lang-quickpoint-5296-combo-grid-plate', '45748', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>Die Quick•Point® 52 / 96 Kombi-Rasterplatte vereint die beiden Rastermaße 52 mm und 96 mm und ist somit in der Lage, die komplette Bandbreite an einsatzbaren LANG Spannmitteln aufzunehmen. Diese Variante ohne vordefinierte Befestigungsbohrungen und Passungen kann gemäß der Ausführung des Maschinentisches individuell nach Kundenwunsch angepasst werden. Durch Aneinanderreihen von zwei oder mehreren dieser Kombi-Platten lässt sich zudem ein plattenübergreifendes, durchgängiges 96 mm Nullpunktraster realisieren.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697307827652adcb3c7bfe45748.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 171, '2023-10-15 01:23:47', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ae45d3203a-prod-48011715083441708', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 246 x 27 mm, without mounting bores, for individual centre hole', '45843-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-246-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores-for-individual-centre-hole', '45843', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The special arrangement of the clamping mechanism inside the plate allows not only the insertion of mounting holes and keyways, but also an individual center hole up to Ø 80 mm, which offers a possibility for rotary joints. This zero-point plate is clamped via 2 opposite actuation screws.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697309789652ae45d31c1e45843.webp', '[\"1697309789652ae45d31e9045843_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 172, '2023-10-15 01:56:29', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652aec78aacd0-prod-11480288452689914', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 196 x 27 mm, without mounting bores, for individual centre hole', '45823-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-196-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores-for-individual-centre-hole', '45823', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The special arrangement of the clamping mechanism inside the plate allows not only the insertion of mounting holes and keyways, but also an individual center hole up to Ø 80 mm, which offers a possibility for rotary joints. This zero-point plate is clamped via 2 opposite actuation screws.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697311864652aec78aa98445823[1].webp', '[\"1697311864652aec78aabbe45823_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 173, '2023-10-15 02:31:04', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652af10047f41-prod-35909502960963040', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 176 x 27 mm, without mounting bores, for individual centre hole', '45803-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-176-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores-for-individual-centre-hole', '45803', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The special arrangement of the clamping mechanism inside the plate allows not only the insertion of mounting holes and keyways, but also an individual center hole up to Ø 80 mm, which offers a possibility for rotary joints. This zero-point plate is clamped via 2 opposite actuation screws.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697313024652af10047bb945803[1].webp', '[\"1697313024652af10047de045803_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 174, '2023-10-15 02:50:24', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bbf6c521be-prod-86476035606545092', 'Quick•Point® 52, Round Plate ø 157 x 27 mm, without mounting bores, for individual centre hole', '45903-lang-quickpoint-52-round-plate-o-157-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores-for-individual-centre-hole', '45903', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The special arrangement of the clamping mechanism inside the plate allows not only the insertion of mounting holes and keyways, but also an individual center hole up to Ø 38 mm, which offers a possibility for rotary joints. This zero-point plate is clamped via 2 opposite clamping screws.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697365868652bbf6c51d5045903[1].webp', '[\"1697365868652bbf6c51fcd45903_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 175, '2023-10-15 17:31:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bc23128c14-prod-42232437157591840', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 246 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for machine tables with cross slot', '45890-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-246-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-machine-tables-with-cross-slot', '45890', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The largest round Quick•Point® single plate is prepared for mounting on machine tables with cross-shaped slots, such as Matsuura or Hermle, thanks to its mounting holes (4x 90° / radius 110 mm). On its underside, there are two keyways with 14H7 and 18H7.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697366577652bc231287d445890.webp', '[\"1697366577652bc23128a3445890_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 176, '2023-10-15 17:42:57', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bc83213c2b-prod-81556784042428966', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 246 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45840-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-246-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45840', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The largest of the round Quick•Point® single plates with Ø 246 mm contains neither mounting holes nor keyways as standard and, due to its available surface, can be modified in many ways to be provided with the corresponding hole pattern for the machine table. Direct mounting on system tables, such as those from Hermle, is also possible.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697368114652bc8321383745840.webp', '[\"1697368114652bc83213aa245840_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 177, '2023-10-15 18:08:34', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bcc072c588-prod-66978110653845166', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 196 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45820-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-196-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45820', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 96 round plate with a diameter of 196 mm can be provided with individual mounting holes to attach it to rotary tables and trunnions. Example possibilities are Haas TR 200, Fanuc Robodrill/Häberle and Lehmann rotary tables, as well as the rotary table of the Hurco VMX 42 with cross-shaped slot<span style=\"color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);\"=\"\">.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697369095652bcc072c25545820[1].webp', '[\"1697369169652bcc517f82b45820_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 178, '2023-10-15 18:24:55', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bce69dbbbf-prod-69727745338388861', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 176 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45801-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-176-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45801', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 96 round plate without a predefined hole pattern can be modified to allow mounting on rotary tables and axes with a diameter of 180 mm or more, including variants from the manufacturers Haas or Nikken.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697369705652bce69db84f45801[1].webp', '[\"1697369705652bce69dba6d45801_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 179, '2023-10-15 18:35:05', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bd1e76d31f-prod-62102385013889134', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 176 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 63 mm slot distance and 150 mm distance', '45800-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-176-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-63-mm-slot-distance-and-150-mm-distance', '45800', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The smallest of all Quick•Point® 96 round plates has a total of six mounting holes. Four holes that can be used for machine tables with 63 mm slot spacing and additionally two further holes in line, which makes this zero-point plate universally applicable for any other slot table variant. Due to its matching mounting holes, it is the logical and only option for the round Quick•Point® aluminium riser.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697370599652bd1e76cf2845800[1].webp', '[\"1697370599652bd1e76d16845800_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 180, '2023-10-15 18:49:59', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bd58e95817-prod-34424386081559587', 'Quick•Point® 52, Round Plate ø 157 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45901-lang-quickpoint-52-round-plate-o-157-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45901', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 52 round plate is typically used on rotary tables with a diameter of 160 mm or more, such as models from Haas. Likewise, it can be mounted on compatible pallets such as Erowa due to the matching mounting hole pattern. Its versatile customisability, for example, with three or four mounting holes, makes this 157 mm diameter round plate a very frequently used Quick•Point® variant.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697371534652bd58e9546345901[1].webp', '[\"1697371534652bd58e9569645901_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 181, '2023-10-15 19:05:34', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bd84ec9a98-prod-45447240498509990', 'Quick•Point® 52, Round Plate ø 157 x 27 mm, with mounting bores at a distance of 100 mm', '45900-lang-quickpoint-52-round-plate-o-157-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-at-a-distance-of-100-mm', '45900', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This Quick•Point® 52 variant with a diameter of 157 mm can be used flexibly on 4th axis applications, slot tables and machine tables with grid holes thanks to its two mounting holes at 100 mm intervals. In addition, its M 10 thread offers the possibility of mounting Quick•Point® 96 clamping studs, in order to be converted into a receiver plate.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697372238652bd84ec903245900[1].png', '[\"1697372238652bd84ec985845900_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 182, '2023-10-15 19:17:18', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bdb1dab283-prod-98175835960545867', 'Quick•Point® 52, Round Plate ø 116 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45751-lang-quickpoint-52-round-plate-o-116-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45751', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>Due to its size, this round plate is a solution for small tables and axes. With a diameter of only 116 mm, it is the most compact of all Quick•Point® zero-point plates. It offers options for creating individual holes, but can also be attached via an adaptation flange, such as on Lehmann rotary tables.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697372957652bdb1daaf2145751[1].webp', '[\"1697372957652bdb1dab11945751_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 183, '2023-10-15 19:29:17', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bddee78ec4-prod-24905225617493215', 'Quick•Point® 52, Round Plate ø 116 x 27 mm, with mounting bores at a distance of 96 mm', '45750-lang-quickpoint-52-round-plate-o-116-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-at-a-distance-of-96-mm', '45750', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>Due to its size, this round plate is a solution for small tables and axes. With a diameter of only 116 mm, it is the most compact of all Quick•Point® zero-point plates. It has 2 mounting holes at a distance of 96 mm and is often adapted to small sub-plates.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697373678652bddee78b5d45750[1].webp', '[\"1697373678652bddee78d3845750_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 184, '2023-10-15 19:41:18', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652be214f0d15-prod-40764877329080918', 'Quick•Point® 96, Single Plate 192 x 156 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45401-lang-quickpoint-96-single-plate-192-x-156-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45401', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 96 plate with the dimensions 192 x 156 x 27 mm and without predefined mounting holes is a common solution for self-made fixtures, risers or trunnions and fits all LANG vises with a base width of 125 mm or clamping devises with a 96 mm zero-point pitch.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697374740652be214f096445401[1].webp', '[\"1697374740652be214f0ba445401_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 185, '2023-10-15 19:59:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652be4accea7f-prod-44877041862147725', 'Quick•Point® 96, Single Plate 192 x 156 x 27 mm, with bores 150 x 100 / 50 mm and clamping edge', '45400-lang-quickpoint-96-single-plate-192-x-156-x-27-mm-with-bores-150-x-100-50-mm-and-clamping-edge', '45400', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The clamping edge of this zero-point plate allows it to be mounted on essentially all machine tables if clamps are used for this purpose. The Quick•Point® 96 variant is also popular as an interface on pallet automations or on your own customized clamping fixture. Its mounting holes are also suitable for the Quick•Point® riser made of aluminium, which can be used to improve accessibility for 5-sided machining.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697375404652be4acce88245400[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 186, '2023-10-15 20:10:04', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652be814148d2-prod-24311041383864993', 'Quick•Point® 52, Single Plate 150 x 116 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45151-lang-quickpoint-52-single-plate-150-x-116-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45151', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 52 plate with the dimensions 150 x 116 x 27 mm and without predefined mounting holes can be individually adapted to your own clamping fixtures, trunnions or risers.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697376276652be8141456e45151[1].webp', '[\"1697376276652be8141478e45151_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 187, '2023-10-15 20:24:36', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652beb6db64db-prod-74175063087802367', 'Quick•Point® 52, Single Plate 150 x 116 x 27 mm, with bores 100 x 50 mm and clamping edge', '45150-lang-quickpoint-52-single-plate-150-x-116-x-27-mm-with-bores-100-x-50-mm-and-clamping-edge', '45150', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Quick•Point® 52 zero-point plate with a clamping edge is primarily used in conjunction with the Quick•Point® risers made of aluminium, which contains threaded holes to match the hole pattern of the zero-point plate. In addition, this variant is often used on customized risers and clamping devises, in order to be able to use LANG vises or fixtures with Quick•Point® clamping studs.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697377133652beb6db62eb45150[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 188, '2023-10-15 20:38:53', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bee1baec1c-prod-62505787411199928', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate extended, 246 x 192 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45716-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-extended-246-x-192-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45716', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The extended grid plate without predefined mounting holes can be specially drilled for machine tables with a slot spacing of 80 mm, among others. If two or more of these extended grid plates are joined together, a continuous 96 mm grid is created, with which vises or other clamping devises can be clamped in a cross-plate arrangement.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697377819652bee1bae90345716[1].webp', '[\"1697377819652bee1baeb1045716_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 189, '2023-10-15 20:50:19', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bf0d159329-prod-98588407562722553', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate extended, 246 x 192 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 100 mm slot distance', '45715-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-extended-246-x-192-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-100-mm-slot-distance', '45715', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This zero-point plate variant has mounting holes spaced at 150 x 200 mm. This “extended” grid plate with edge dimensions of 192 x 246 mm is thus a suitable solution for machine tables with a slot spacing of 100 mm, as is common, for example, with the machine manufacturers Grob or Mazak. By joining several of these plates in an x-axis direction, a continuous 96 mm grid can be created, which allows cross-plate clamping.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697378513652bf0d158fd645715[1].webp', '[\"1697378513652bf0d15920b45715_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 190, '2023-10-15 21:01:53', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bf70f551b6-prod-85370487374516472', 'Quick•Point® 96, Round Plate ø 246 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 63 mm slot distance', '45863-lang-quickpoint-96-round-plate-o-246-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-63-mm-slot-distance', '45863', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This round plate is a visually attractive solution for zero-point clamping on round machine tables with a slot spacing of 63 mm. With a diameter of 246 mm, it can act flush as a base for a round Quick•Point® automation zero-point device for RoboTrex 96, for example.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697380111652bf70f54cac45863.webp', '[\"1697380111652bf70f54f9f45863_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 191, '2023-10-15 21:28:31', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bf9bb1c351-prod-69422591562748583', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 192 x 192 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 63 mm slot distance', '45763-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-192-x-192-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-63-mm-slot-distance', '45763', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This grid plate is predestined for machine tables with a slot spacing of 63 mm. Due to its external dimensions of 192 x 192 mm, the operator is able to create a continuous 96 mm zero-point grid system by lining up several of these plates and placing the workholding device across the plates. Likewise, this plate can be combined with multiple grid plates, such as the 2- or 4-fold grid plate.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697380795652bf9bb1b2b145763[1].png', '[\"1697380795652bf9bb1c16445763_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 192, '2023-10-15 21:39:55', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652bfdaa28d1b-prod-96429594077396906', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 192 x 192 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for Quick•Tower tombstone', '75710-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-192-x-192-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-quicktower-tombstone', '75710', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>Just like the smaller version with the Art. No. 75600, this grid plate also has predefined mounting holes for the Quick•Tower spaced at 150 x 120 mm. Thanks to its fits, it can be plugged in via bushings and aligned with high precision on the Quick•Tower.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697381802652bfdaa2890475710[1]_0.webp', '[\"1697381802652bfdaa28b6475710_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 193, '2023-10-15 21:56:42', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652c01a3192c8-prod-20565422042426531', 'Quick•Point® 96, Single Plate 192 x 192 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45710-lang-quickpoint-96-single-plate-192-x-192-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45710', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This Quick•Point® 96 grid plate is a customisable version for which mounting holes and fits can be made according to the requirements of the machine table. Lining up two or more of these plates with an edge dimension of 192 x 192 mm results in a continuous 96 mm zero-point grid system across the plate<span style=\"color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);\"=\"\">s.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697382819652c01a318f2645710[1].webp', '[\"1697382819652c01a31915c45710_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 194, '2023-10-15 22:13:39', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652c050053d78-prod-12126716185928969', 'Quick•Point® 52, Grid Plate 104 x 104 x 27 mm, with bores for Quick•Tower tombstone', '75600-lang-quickpoint-52-grid-plate-104-x-104-x-27-mm-with-bores-for-quicktower-tombstone', '75600', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>With external dimensions of 104 x 104 mm, this grid plate is one of the smallest in the Quick•Point® series. It has mounting holes for M10 / M12 cylinder head screws. Its hole spacing of 82 x 82 mm is suitable for both dimensions of the Quick•Tower clamping tower for horizontal machining centers, as well as for the smaller 3- and 4-sided clamping towers MT3 and MT4. Customers also like to use it on their own trunnions, towers and angular clamps<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697383680652c0500539ef75600[1].webp', '[\"1697383680652c050053c3975600_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 195, '2023-10-15 22:28:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652c0784ac012-prod-76467606551933988', 'Quick•Point® 52, Single Plate 104 x 104 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45600-lang-quickpoint-52-single-plate-104-x-104-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45600', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651282a23af76-ctgr-63998095641569884', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The smallest of the Quick•Point® plates with a grid size of 52 mm is often mounted in rows on trunnions or clamping towers and is used for the multiple clamping of smaller components. It is also used on pallets or angular clamps. It comes without predefined mounting holes, which allows for their individual creation. In its corners, it provides space for mounting holes up to a countersunk diameter of 17.5 mm.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697384324652c0784abc6545600[1].webp', '[\"1697384324652c0784abe5a45600.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 196, '2023-10-15 22:38:44', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652c23f0da311-prod-66329652040528108', 'Quick•Point® 96, Modular Plate 2-fold', '85720-lang-quickpoint-96-modular-plate-2-fold', '85720', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284a0c82ee-ctgr-91160213277252809', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The new expandable Quick•Point® modular plates are characterized by even more simple, faster and user-friendly handling.With just one tightening screw, several module plates can be actuated together. A total of two 2-fold modular plates and one 1-fold modular plate can be connected in series (resulting in a length of 960 mm in the y-direction). This makes it easy to create a cross-plate zero-point grid across the entire machine table that works in both the x- and y-directions. The Quick•Point® modular plates are available without predefined mounting holes, which allows completely individual adaptation to the conditions of the machine table. LANG offers the insertion of the necessary mounting holes as a service, but this can also be done by the customer.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697391600652c23f0d9f9985720_1.webp', '[\"1697391600652c23f0da20885720_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 209, '2023-10-16 00:40:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652c27141a264-prod-32446495790435154', 'Quick•Point® 96, Modular Plate 1-fold', '85710-lang-quickpoint-96-modular-plate-1-fold', '85710', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284a0c82ee-ctgr-91160213277252809', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The new expandable Quick•Point® modular plates are characterized by even more simple, faster and user-friendly handling. The 1-fold modular plate is usually added to a 2-fold modular plate and connected to it via a connecting set. The patented clamping mechanism allows the connected modular plates to be actuated with just one tightening screw and clamping devices can be clamped in a cross-plate zero-point grid. The Quick•Point® modular plates are available without predefined mounting holes and can therefore be individually adapted to the conditions of the machine table. LANG offers the insertion of the necessary mounting holes as a service, but this can also be done by the customer.<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697392404652c271419f2d85710[1].webp', '[\"1697392404652c27141a14885710_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 210, '2023-10-16 00:53:24', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652cca561c3b2-prod-59825179796049972', 'Vario•Tec 125, Centering Vise', '42252-125-lang-variotec-125-centering-vise', '42252-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '652c2e1024a72-ctgr-25355305303292223', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Vario•Tec centering vise offers a convenient and variable support and positioning system for (semi-) finished workpieces. The Vario•Tec clamping jaws contain movable pins with high positioning accuracy, which are blown out row by row with compressed air and can be pushed back individually when not in use, thus generating specific clamping angles. This facilitates the easy and repeatable setting of the desired configuration and eliminates the need for additional workpiece end stops and parallels.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697434198652cca561bd1942252-125[1].webp', '[\"1697434198652cca561c01a42252-125_Seite_3.webp\",\"1697434198652cca561c10442252-125_Seite_2.webp\",\"1697434198652cca561c26042252-125_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 145, '2023-10-16 12:29:58', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652cccbda04d4-prod-89404600371994588', 'Vario•Tec 125, Centering Vise', '42202-125-lang-variotec-125-centering-vise', '42202-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '652c2e1024a72-ctgr-25355305303292223', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Vario•Tec centering vise offers a convenient and variable support and positioning system for (semi-) finished workpieces. The Vario•Tec clamping jaws contain movable pins with high positioning accuracy, which are blown out row by row with compressed air and can be pushed back individually when not in use, thus generating specific clamping angles. This facilitates the easy and repeatable setting of the desired configuration and eliminates the need for additional workpiece end stops and parallels.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697434813652cccbd9f14142202-125[1].png', '[\"1697434813652cccbd9feee42202-125_Seite_3.jpg\",\"1697434813652cccbda008b42202-125_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697434813652cccbda02d442202-125_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 146, '2023-10-16 12:40:13', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540');
