eite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697453453652d158d5892d44006_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 218, '2023-10-16 10:50:53', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d15a6710d0-prod-62824565346785664', 'Preci•Point 52, Collet', '41000-06-lang-precipoint-52-collet', '41000-06', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '652ce038a4b44-ctgr-44412779975882227', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The standard collet chuck type ER-50 as per DIN 6499-B / ISO 15488 listed here is suitable for the Preci•Point 52 collet chuck with part no. 41052. The tolerance to the specified clamping diameter is -1.0 mm.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697453478652d15a670da141000-06_0.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 166, '2023-10-16 10:51:18', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d188340ebb-prod-83521722030754225', 'RoboTrex 96, Automation Trolley', '64016-lang-robotrex-96-automation-trolley', '64016', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128432f1893-ctgr-99132512019439993', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The RoboTrex 96 automation system’s automation trolley has a storage capacity of 16 vises, which are stored vertically, in order to be picked up by the robot. When fully loaded, the maximum workpiece size is 205 x 150 x 150 mm. For the use of higher or wider workpieces, individual vise positions or complete rows can be left free or deselected via the system’s control function. Thanks to its flexibility and mobility, the automation trolley can be pre-equipped off-line regardless of location.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697454211652d18833fdf264016[1].png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 257, '2023-10-16 11:03:31', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d18fd0d629-prod-45975121000216856', 'Quick•Point® 96, Riser 192 x 156 mm, height 100 mm', '44100-lang-quickpoint-96-riser-192-x-156-mm-height-100-mm', '44100', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284f656096-ctgr-77906078302167297', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">A riser improves accessibility in 5-sided machining and can either be mounted directly and firmly on the machine table or set up and removed on a zero-point plate. It is available in round and rectangular versions in heights of 60 and 100 mm. The suitable zero-point plate Item No. 45400 ist pinned, aligned and mounted to the riser via bushings.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697454333652d18fd0d1aa44100[1].webp', '[\"1697454333652d18fd0d40744100_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697454333652d18fd0d4b944100_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 219, '2023-10-16 11:05:33', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d195c3d8f8-prod-62821403636518821', 'RoboTrex 96, Automation Trolley', '64015-lang-robotrex-96-automation-trolley', '64015', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128432f1893-ctgr-99132512019439993', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The RoboTrex 96 automation system’s automation trolley has a storage capacity of 15 vises, which are stored vertically, in order to be picked up by the robot. When fully loaded, the maximum workpiece size is 205 x 205 x 90 mm. For the use of higher or wider workpieces, individual vise positions or complete rows can be left free or deselected via the system’s control function. Thanks to its flexibility and mobility, the automation trolley can be pre-equipped off-line regardless of location.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697454428652d195c3c89164015[1].png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 258, '2023-10-16 11:07:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d1a9c84fca-prod-61226414757220243', 'RoboTrex 52, Automation Zero-Point Clamping System - Mechanical', '66500-lang-robotrex-52-automation-zero-point-clamping-system-mechanical', '66500', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651284f58498b-ctgr-47127144296871148', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The mechanical zero-point clamping system for the RoboTrex 52 automation system is opened and clamped by the robot via a lever. Like the Quick•Point® zero-point clamping system, it guarantees highly accurate positioning of the clamping devises with a repeat accuracy of &lt; 0.005 mm.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697454748652d1a9c83e2566500[1].png', '[\"1697454748652d1a9c8499a66500_Seite_3[1].jpg\",\"1697454748652d1a9c84bd466500_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697454748652d1a9c84d9166500_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 261, '2023-10-16 11:12:28', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d1b4bc9981-prod-77830814463086855', 'Quick•Point® 96, Riser 192 x 156 mm, height 60 mm', '44060-lang-quickpoint-96-riser-192-x-156-mm-height-60-mm', '44060', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284f656096-ctgr-77906078302167297', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This riser is suitable for creating the necessary distance between the machine table and the workpiece in 5-axis machining, thus benefiting from improved accessibility. The matching Quick•Point® plate has part number 45400. The riser can be fixed directly and firmly to the machine table. It can also be clamped in a zero point plate via its zero point clamping studs. In addition to this version with an overall height of 60 mm, it is also available with a height of 100 mm and as a round version.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697454923652d1b4bc94fd44060[1].webp', '[\"1697454923652d1b4bc977f44060_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697454923652d1b4bc985044060_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 220, '2023-10-16 11:15:23', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d1cb36cbe9-prod-12246247952382008', 'Quick•Point® 52, Riser 150 x 116 mm, height 100 mm', '43100-lang-quickpoint-52-riser-150-x-116-mm-height-100-mm', '43100', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284f656096-ctgr-77906078302167297', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">A riser improves accessibility in 5-sided machining and can either be mounted directly and firmly on the machine table or set up and removed on a zero-point plate. It is available in round and rectangular versions in heights of 60 and 100 mm. The zero-point plates are pinned, aligned and mounted to the riser via bushings.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697455283652d1cb36c53b43100[1].webp', '[\"1697455283652d1cb36c9b743100_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697455283652d1cb36ca9543100_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 221, '2023-10-16 11:21:23', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d1e76a7d20-prod-41787471596887018', 'Quick•Point® 52, Riser 150 x 116 mm, height 60 mm', '43060-lang-quickpoint-52-riser-150-x-116-mm-height-60-mm', '43060', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651284f656096-ctgr-77906078302167297', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The riser creates additional distance to the machine table and reduces interfering contours in 5-sided machining. This riser is used together with the Quick•Point® zero point plate 45150, which is pinned to it via fitting bushes, aligned and then mounted with cylinder head screws. The riser can be equipped with Ø 16 mm as well as Ø 20 mm clamping studs, which makes it universally applicable in both systems - Quick•Point® 52 and 96. With the large clamping studs in its base, it can even be used as an adapter plate with the zero point plate mentioned above.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697455734652d1e76a772843060[1].webp', '[\"1697455734652d1e76a7ad143060_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697455734652d1e76a7c3043060_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 222, '2023-10-16 11:28:54', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d1e9a37586-prod-64554548317326194', 'RoboTrex 52, Gripper', '66930-lang-robotrex-52-gripper', '66930', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This new gripper variant for the RoboTrex 52 automation system opens and clamps the mechanical zero-point clamping system via its lever. The maximum weight of workpieces held in either the Makro•Grip® 5-axis vice 77 or the Makro•Grip® Night King on RoboTrex 52 is 12 kg.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697455770652d1e9a3633d66930.png', '[\"1697455770652d1e9a3712066930_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697455770652d1e9a3737666930_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 262, '2023-10-16 11:29:30', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d200f911b3-prod-23993081125306838', 'RoboTrex 96, Gripper', '64801-lang-robotrex-96-gripper', '64801', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This gripper variant is suitable for all older RoboTrex 96 automation systems without gripper exchange interface, or for own robot solutions where no gripper exchange is desired or necessary. In all RoboTrex 96 automation systems with this gripper variant – but without gripper change interface – the maximum workpiece weight is 30 or 50 kg, depending on the robot version.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697456143652d200f905bf64801[1].png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 263, '2023-10-16 11:35:43', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d20d0387e6-prod-46395899878070645', 'RoboTrex 96, Gripper', '64850-lang-robotrex-96-gripper', '64850', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The gripper for the RoboTrex 96 automation system is equipped with Quick-Point® zero-point clamping studs on its back and is picked up by the gripper exchange interface. The zero-point clamping system opens and clamps the gripper via its pneumatic interface. Depending on the robot version selected, the maximum workpiece weight is 25 or 45 kg.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697456336652d20d03751964850[1].png', '[\"1697456336652d20d03838364850_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697456336652d20d0385c064850_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 264, '2023-10-16 11:38:56', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d21c1388f5-prod-59469946683686357', 'RoboTrex 52, Gripper', '66950-lang-robotrex-52-gripper', '66950', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This “small” gripper variant for system size 52, which is used in the RoboTex 96 automation system thanks to the gripper exchange interface, actuates the zero-point clamping system via its pneumatic interface. The maximum weight of workpieces held in either the Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise 77 or the Makro•Grip® Night King is 15 kg.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697456577652d21c1374ab66950[1].png', '[\"1697456577652d21c1384da66950_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697456577652d21c13870266950_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 265, '2023-10-16 11:42:57', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d229d9b4da-prod-58116048248222491', 'RoboTrex 52, Gripper', '66900-lang-robotrex-52-gripper', '66900', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This gripper variant for the RoboTrex 52 automation system opens and clamps the zero-point clamping system via its pneumatic interface but can also actuate the mechanical zero-point clamping system. The maximum weight of workpieces held in either the Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise 77 or the Makro•Grip® Night King on RoboTrex 52 is 12 kg.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697456797652d229d9a40b66900[1].png', '[\"1697456797652d229d9b07666900_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697456797652d229d9b24d66900_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 266, '2023-10-16 11:46:37', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d236713597-prod-29321961153856580', 'RoboTrex 52, Gripper', '66801-lang-robotrex-52-gripper', '66801', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '651285a48012e-ctgr-97326573643265920', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This gripper variant for the RoboTrex 52 automation system opens and clamps the mechanical zero-point clamping system via its lever. The maximum weight of workpieces held in either the Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise 77 or the Makro•Grip® Night King on RoboTrex 52 is 12 kg.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697456999652d2367125ed66801[1].png', '[\"1697456999652d23671312b66801_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697456999652d23671333266801_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 267, '2023-10-16 11:49:59', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d24521fa00-prod-28366354547354079', 'RoboTrex, Gripper Exchange Interface', '64266-lang-robotrex-gripper-exchange-interface', '64266', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '6512861f57b3e-ctgr-29769162189308831', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The gripper exchange interface is a pneumatic zero-point interface on the RoboTrex 96 automation system robot that allows changing between RoboTrex 52 and 96 grippers. It ensures that the full range of components from both system sizes can be used in the same system, providing even greater part variety and increased flexibility in the manufacturing process.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697457234652d24521e65b64266[1].png', '[\"1697457234652d24521f51f64266_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697457234652d24521f6e164266_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 268, '2023-10-16 11:53:54', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d25872e038-prod-11548992603475909', 'Makro•Grip®, Mobile Storage Unit', '61060-lang-makrogrip-mobile-storage-unit', '61060', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '6512869ae268f-ctgr-66325571830385315', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Makro•Grip® mobile storage unit enables the space-saving, flexible storage of vises and fixtures equipped with Quick•Point® clamping studs. Regardless of the system size or the grid of the clamping studs, its maximum storage capacity is 60 clamping devises</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697457543652d25872cbc361060[1].png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 269, '2023-10-16 11:59:03', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d271f8e385-prod-85169485916845767', 'Makro•Grip® 77, HAUBEX 5-Axis Vise', '61085-46-lang-makrogrip-77-haubex-5-axis-vise', '61085-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">HAUBEX uses a modified version of the Makro•Grip® as the workholding device. The slim design of the 5-Axis Vice and the narrow jaw width of 46 mm ensure ideal accessibility in 5-sided machining of blanks. The maximum workpiece size of approx. 80 × 75 × 70 mm is given by the height and diameter of the workholding hood. Examples of possible dimensions and a formula for their calculation can be found on the data sheet in the downloads.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697457951652d271f8d80461085-46.png', '[\"1700824129656084417b88761085-46_Seite_2.webp\",\"1700824129656084417ba3c61085-46_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, '2023-10-16 12:05:51', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d27dab64fb-prod-17458598964588175', 'Quick•Point® 96, 3-face Pyramid ø 400 x 150 mm, incl. 3x Quick•Point® 96 Round Plate 45800', '43400-lang-quickpoint-96-3-face-pyramid-o-400-x-150-mm-incl-3x-quickpoint-96-round-plate-45800', '43400', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '651285124fc27-ctgr-39187384997716203', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The ideally accessible, high-strength aluminium system body with recessed zero-point plates made of case-hardened steel is particularly suitable for increasing the machine runtimes of 5-axis machining centers. Given that the 3-sided pyramid has an integrated zero-point interface, the operator also benefits from optimized set-up times. Depending on the clamping direction of the system bodies, they can realize a clamping range of max. 205 mm (vertical) or max. 255 mm (horizontal).</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697458138652d27dab5f2743400[1].webp', '[\"1697458138652d27dab617243400_Seite_3[1].jpg\",\"1697458138652d27dab621d43400_Seite_4[1].jpg\",\"1697458138652d27dab638943400_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697458138652d27dab642143400_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 236, '2023-10-16 12:08:58', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d2f5459bef-prod-23717891576246459', 'Clean•Tec 260, Ø 3/4\" Shaft, Chip Fan', '34260-lang-cleantec-260-o-34-shaft-chip-fan', '34260', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128c2f9ad96-ctgr-94381657184854866', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The medium-size version of the Clean•Tec chip fan with a shaft diameter of 19.05 mm (3/4 inch), is suitable for universal cleaning tasks. By controlling the speed of the machine spindle, it opens and closes its blades and efficiently frees workpieces and fixtures from chips and cooling.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697460052652d2f54584a934260_geschlossen.png', '[\"1697460052652d2f5458b6d34260_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697460052652d2f5458cd234260_Seite_1.jpg\",\"1697460052652d2f5458dcf34260_offen.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 248, '2023-10-16 12:40:52', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d305a391cc-prod-17858090953634182', 'Clean•Tec 160, Ø 3/4\" Shaft, Chip Fan', '34160-lang-cleantec-160-o-34-shaft-chip-fan', '34160', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128c2f9ad96-ctgr-94381657184854866', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The smallest version of the Clean•Tec chip fan with a shaft diameter of 19.05 mm (3/4 inch), is particularly suitable for targeted cleaning tasks such as blowing out pocket holes and tends to be used in smaller machines. By controlling the speed of the machine spindle, it opens and closes its blades and efficiently frees workpieces and fixtures from chips and cooling.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697460314652d305a37e6e34160_geschlossen.png', '[\"1697460314652d305a384af34160_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697460314652d305a3863834160_Seite_1.jpg\",\"1697460314652d305a387ff34160_offen.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 249, '2023-10-16 12:45:14', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d30b58ba42-prod-31145345939508931', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 4-fold, 384 x 384 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 100 mm slot distance', '45742-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-4-fold-384-x-384-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-100-mm-slot-distance', '45742', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '65128435cefa8-ctgr-59275437180590163', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The 4-fold grid plate 96 can be described as THE “base plate” of incomparable quality. And not without good reason! Thanks to the multitude of locating options, its versatility and the expansion possibilities it has to offer, it is often the first choice when users are just starting out with the zero-point clamping system. Its flexibility keeps all options open for future, perhaps still unknown applications.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697460405652d30b58b5c145742[1].webp', '[\"1697460467652d30f3dbf1945742_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 197, '2023-10-16 12:46:45', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d3178803fd-prod-75010499802922756', 'Clean•Tec 330, Ø 20mm Shaft, Chip Fan', '30330-lang-cleantec-330-o-20mm-shaft-chip-fan', '30330', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128c2f9ad96-ctgr-94381657184854866', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 20px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The largest version of the Clean•Tec chip fan, whose body can be clamped in any standard Ø 20 mm tool holder, is particularly suitable for cleaning large areas and is, therefore, more likely to be used in larger machines. By controlling the speed of the machine spindle, it opens and closes its blades and efficiently frees workpieces and fixtures from chips and cooling.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697460600652d31787e78230330_geschlossen[1].png', '[\"1697460600652d31787f0bd30330_Seite_2.jpg\",\"1697460600652d31787f25430330_Seite_1.jpg\",\"1697460600652d31787f38630330_offen[1].png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 250, '2023-10-16 12:50:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540');
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `code`, `brand_id`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `price`, `show_price`, `show_price_to_partner`, `key_features`, `further_information`, `discount_type`, `discount`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `status`, `features`, `meta_title`, `meta_tags`, `meta_descriptions`, `ancestor_id`, `short_number`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `company_id`) VALUES
('652d34e3f0398-prod-44869497277930023', 'Quick•Point® 52/96, Twin Base 192 x 116 x 247 mm', '47548-lang-quickpoint-5296-twin-base-192-x-116-x-247-mm', '47548', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512852d06dc5-ctgr-30003200427044464', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Clamping device and workpiece can be rotated by 4x 90° with high repeatability in the twin base so that 5-face machining is also possible in 3-axis machines or on fourth axes. The combined zero-point grids of 52 and 96 mm on both sides of the twin base offer a free choice of clamping device, regardless of the vise size.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697461475652d34e3effde47548[1].webp', '[\"1697461475652d34e3f025247548_neu.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 223, '2023-10-16 13:04:35', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d381bb515b-prod-27212406829670803', 'Quick•Point® 52, Twin Base 146 x 76 x 168 mm', '47220-lang-quickpoint-52-twin-base-146-x-76-x-168-mm', '47220', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512852d06dc5-ctgr-30003200427044464', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The hardened and ground twin base is ideal for the manual, 5-sided machining of workpieces with 3- or 4 axis machines, as the workpiece can be rotated together with the clamping device by 4x 90° in the zero-point holes of the twin base with repeat accuracy and process reliability.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697462299652d381bb4c2b47220[1].webp', '[\"1697462299652d381bb4ef947220_Seite_2[1].jpg\",\"1697462299652d381bb505347220_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 224, '2023-10-16 13:18:19', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d385f70866-prod-55467933905543281', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 4-fold, 384 x 384 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 63 mm slot distance', '45741-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-4-fold-384-x-384-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-63-mm-slot-distance', '45741', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '65128435cefa8-ctgr-59275437180590163', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The 4-fold grid plate 96 can be described as THE “base plate” of incomparable quality. And not without good reason! Thanks to the multitude of locating options, its versatility and the expansion possibilities it has to offer, it is often the first choice when users are just starting out with the zero-point clamping system. Its flexibility keeps all options open for future, perhaps still unknown applications.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697464724652d4194e0ae745741[1] (1).webp', '[\"1697464724652d4194e0ecf45741_Seite_1[1].jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 198, '2023-10-16 13:19:27', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d3e20c06a9-prod-16001893146444788', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 2-fold, round, ø 384 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 100 mm slot distance', '45964-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-2-fold-round-o-384-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-100-mm-slot-distance', '45964', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '65128435cefa8-ctgr-59275437180590163', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The round 2-fold grid plate 96 is suitable for equipping round machine tables of a medium size with a zero-point clamping system over as large an area as possible. With its mounting hole pattern, it can be mounted on all machine tables with 100 mm slot spacing and is able to accommodate either one or two clamping devises side by side. It is operated via the clamping screw or the Quick-Lock fastener.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697463840652d3e20bfce645964[1].webp', '[\"1697463840652d3e20c00a445964_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 199, '2023-10-16 13:44:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d4464c99ed-prod-33955054760262067', 'Quick•Point®, Tri•Top 3-Face-Tombstone', '43352-lang-quickpoint-tritop-3-face-tombstone', '43352', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512854d27f65-ctgr-68445390690269443', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Tri•Top returns in a fresh design! With its sturdy steel base body, the popular 3-face tombstone is a guarantee for maximum precision. Despite its robustness, the Tri-Top remains handy and has the same interference contours as its predecessor. The 3-fold zero point mounting, suitable for Makro•Grip® 46 and 77, reduces downtimes and tool changes in milling operations.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697465444652d4464c957a43352.webp', '[\"1697465444652d4464c97f243352+3x48160-77.png\",\"1697465444652d4464c98df43352+3x48120-77.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 225, '2023-10-16 14:10:44', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d47573ca73-prod-42233266586026565', 'Quick•Point® 52, 4-face Tombstone 192 x 192 x 260 mm', '70264-lang-quickpoint-52-4-face-tombstone-192-x-192-x-260-mm', '70264', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512854d27f65-ctgr-68445390690269443', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Based on the Quick•Tower clamping tower for horizontal machining centers, the MT4 4-sided clamping tower is an alternative to multiple clamping on smaller 5-axis machines. Two Quick•Point® 52 grid plates or one Quick•Point® 52 2-fold grid plate can be mounted to each of the four side surfaces, allowing a total of eight clamping devises to be accommodated.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697466199652d47573c61f70264.webp', '[\"1697466199652d47573c89770264_Seite_1[1].jpg\",\"1697466199652d47573c96270264_8x75600[1].png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 226, '2023-10-16 14:23:19', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d479f23414-prod-71726469839093628', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 2-fold, round, ø 384 x 27 mm, with mounting bores for 63 mm slot distance', '45963-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-2-fold-round-o-384-x-27-mm-with-mounting-bores-for-63-mm-slot-distance', '45963', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '65128435cefa8-ctgr-59275437180590163', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The round 2-fold grid plate 96 is suitable for equipping round machine tables of a medium size with a zero-point clamping system over as large an area as possible. With its mounting hole pattern, it can be mounted on all machine tables with 63 mm slot spacing and is able to accommodate either one or two clamping devises side by side. It is operated via the clamping screw or the Quick-Lock fastener.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697466271652d479f2301545963[1].webp', '[\"1697466271652d479f231e645963_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, '2023-10-16 14:24:31', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d49a52a86d-prod-59706652827680506', 'Quick•Point® 52, 3-face Tombstone', '70263-lang-quickpoint-52-3-face-tombstone', '70263', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512854d27f65-ctgr-68445390690269443', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Based on the Quick•Tower clamping tower for horizontal machining centers, the MT3 3-sided clamping tower is an alternative to multiple clamping on smaller 5-axis machines. Two Quick•Point® 52 grid plates or one Quick•Point® 52 2-fold grid plate can be mounted to each of the three side surfaces, allowing a total of six clamping devises to be accommodated.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697466789652d49a52a38670263.webp', '[\"1697466789652d49a52a69d70263+75600_Seite_1.jpg\",\"1697466789652d49a52a76f70263_6x75600[1].png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 227, '2023-10-16 14:33:09', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d4bb337d0d-prod-56390747201091791', 'Quick•Point® 96, Grid Plate 2-fold, round, ø 384 x 27 mm, without mounting bores', '45962-lang-quickpoint-96-grid-plate-2-fold-round-o-384-x-27-mm-without-mounting-bores', '45962', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '65128435cefa8-ctgr-59275437180590163', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The round 2-fold grid plate 96 is suitable for equipping round machine tables of a medium size with a zero-point clamping system over as large an area as possible. One or two clamping devises can be clamped side by side in it, and it also fits well visually with round machine tables. On the side where the clamping screw is located, the 2-fold plate has a straight surface, that allows the use of the Quick-Lock fastener.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697467315652d4bb33789545962[1].webp', '[\"1697467315652d4bb337b4f45962_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 201, '2023-10-16 14:41:55', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652d4c2ae891c-prod-97681510132284000', 'Quick•Point® 96, Support Plate 192 x 192 x 27 mm', '45577-lang-quickpoint-96-support-plate-192-x-192-x-27-mm', '45577', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512864dcf7e8-ctgr-55865677902925829', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Support plates are ideal for holding conventional clamping devises and custom-made fixtures for quick and precise set-up in the Quick•Point® zero-point clamping system. The voluminous, non-hardened steel body is available in both system sizes (52 and 96) and with different footprints.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697467434652d4c2ae82f745577[1].webp', '[\"1697467434652d4c2ae864845577_Seite_1_neu.jpg\",\"1697467434652d4c2ae87d745277_Hochgestellt[1]_0.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 232, '2023-10-16 14:43:54', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
