re continuously up to a maximum of 360 bar. The stamping process is triggered by a pneumatic pedal that can be operated by hand or foot. The scope of delivery includes a protective shield and a scaled end stop for the central, repeatable insertion of the blanks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697569699652edba31aa4641200-HE[1].webp', '[\"1697569699652edba31ace841200_Seite_2[1].webp\",\"1697569699652edba31ae8741200_Seite_1[1].webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28, '2023-10-17 19:08:19', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
