tinuously up to a maximum of 360 bar. The stamping process is triggered by a pneumatic pedal that can be operated by hand or foot. The scope of delivery includes a protective shield and a scaled end stop for the central, repeatable insertion of the blanks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697570061652edd0d698c241350.webp', '[\"1697570061652edd0d69f3b41350_Seite_2[1] (1).webp\",\"1697570061652edd0d6a11041350_Seite_1[1] (1).webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29, '2023-10-17 19:14:21', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540');
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `code`, `brand_id`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `price`, `show_price`, `show_price_to_partner`, `key_features`, `further_information`, `discount_type`, `discount`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `status`, `features`, `meta_title`, `meta_tags`, `meta_descriptions`, `ancestor_id`, `short_number`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `company_id`) VALUES
('652ede5141437-prod-72109245354008762', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit - Standard, with standard stamping jaws', '41200-lang-makrogrip-stamping-unit-standard-with-standard-stamping-jaws', '41200', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abbaab1ab-ctgr-61616792649181644', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The standard stamping unit for the workbench is equipped with standard stamping jaws for materials up to 35 HRC. In this version, workpiece blanks up to 245 mm clamping length can be stamped. Quick adjustment of the clamping length is possible as soon as the two locking pins are removed from the system body. Fine adjustment to the corresponding workpiece width is made via a spindle. An adjusting wheel on the hydraulic housing of the stamping unit trolley is used to set the stamping pressure continuously up to a maximum of 360 bar. The stamping process is triggered by a pneumatic pedal that can be operated by hand or foot. The scope of delivery includes a protective shield and a scaled end stop for the central, repeatable insertion of the blanks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697570385652ede5140d9241200[1].webp', '[\"1697570385652ede514118841200_Seite_2[1] (1).webp\",\"1697570385652ede514129141200_Seite_1[1] (1).webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30, '2023-10-17 19:19:45', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee0a198ea6-prod-42721596564215193', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41402-he-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41402-HE', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The dual-stamping unit trolley is used to stamp wide workpieces, which are then held in two Makro•Grip® 5-axis vises. The position of the two stamping unit trolley system bodies can be individually adjusted via the marking holes or plate slots so that the position of the two stampings in the workpiece corresponds to the position of the serrated Makro•Grip® vise jaws. The two stamping unit bodies allow a maximum stamping width of up to 355 mm and stamping of material up to 45 HRC hardness.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697570977652ee0a198abd41402-HE[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 41, '2023-10-17 19:29:37', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee1e96b961-prod-19750524397990313', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41402-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41402', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The dual-stamping unit trolley is used to stamp wide workpieces, which are then held in two Makro•Grip® 5-axis vises. The position of the two stamping unit trolley system bodies can be individually adjusted via the marking holes or plate slots so that the position of the two stampings in the workpiece corresponds to the position of the serrated Makro•Grip® vise jaws. The two stamping unit bodies allow a maximum stamping width of up to 355 mm and stamping of material up to 35 HRC hardness.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697571305652ee1e96b37e41402[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 42, '2023-10-17 19:35:05', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee3408c710-prod-54825108412684221', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41400-he-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41400-HE', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. This stamping unit trolley is equipped with a slot plate on which an extended stamping unit body with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and High-End stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 45 HRC is mounted. Via the plate slots, the system body can either be moved freely or offset in a defined way via marking holes. Retrofitting an additional stamping unit trolley for dual-stamping is also possible.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697571648652ee3408c2eb41400-HE[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 43, '2023-10-17 19:40:48', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee49e52ab8-prod-62152849553622798', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41400-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41400', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. This stamping unit trolley is equipped with a slot plate on which an extended stamping unit body with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and standard stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 35 HRC is mounted. Via the plate slots, the system body can either be moved freely or offset in a defined way via marking holes. Retrofitting an additional stamping unit trolley for dual-stamping is also possible.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697571998652ee49e5272b41400[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44, '2023-10-17 19:46:38', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee5fb0220b-prod-90051879774319782', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41521-he-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41521-HE', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. The system body of the mobile stamping unit trolley in its standard version with a stamping width of up to 245 mm and High-End stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 45 HRC is mounted directly on the stamping unit trolley. The pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier is mounted inside the stamping unit trolley. To the left and right of the system body, the operator has sufficient space and storage area, for example, to set up vises with the stamped blanks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697572347652ee5fb0177b41521-HE[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 45, '2023-10-17 19:52:27', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('652ee71d37cf6-prod-54448667974062055', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '41521-lang-makrogrip-stamping-trolley', '41521', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. The system body of the mobile stamping unit trolley in its standard version with a stamping width of up to 245 mm and stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 35 HRC is mounted directly on the stamping unit trolley. The pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier is mounted inside the stamping unit trolley. To the left and right of the system body, the operator has sufficient space and storage area, for example, to set up vises with the stamped blanks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697572637652ee71d3784641521[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 46, '2023-10-17 19:57:17', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('653054fedcc36-prod-47129558915612655', 'Quick•Point® Rail, Clamping bar', '73340-lang-quickpoint-rail-clamping-bar', '73340', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512872f5bdaa-ctgr-73576442895618357', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Quick•Point® Rail is an innovative clamping system that allows zero point risers and 5-Axis Vises to be attached quickly. Here, the clamping bar is inserted directly into the groove of the machine table or mounted on an automation pallet - without having to make any changes to the base. The single clamping bar can also be extended with extension bars if more than two clamping elements are to be clamped next to each other. This version of the clamping bar has no mounting holes as standard and can be adapted to a possible hole pattern of the base, depending on requirements.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1697666302653054fedc44573340.webp', '[\"1697666302653054fedca4a73340.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 242, '2023-10-18 21:58:22', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('653056687123b-prod-42001812749848186', 'Quick•Point® Rail, Clamping bar', '73345-lang-quickpoint-rail-clamping-bar', '73345', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512872f5bdaa-ctgr-73576442895618357', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Quick•Point® Rail is a quick clamping system for holding zero point risers and 5-Axis Vises. Here, the clamping bar is inserted directly into the groove of the machine table or attached to an automation pallet without any modification of the base. The clamping bar can be used either individually or in combination with extension bars if more than two clamping devices are to be used side by side. With its holes spaced 50 mm apart, it can be mounted on pallets with exactly this hole pattern or fixed in the machine table using sliding blocks.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976666646530566870f6273345.webp', '[\"1697666664653056687115773345.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 243, '2023-10-18 22:04:24', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530583812e39-prod-49069067169882662', 'Quick•Point® Rail 52/96, 5-Axis Combi Riser', '73487-lang-quickpoint-rail-5296-5-axis-combi-riser', '73487', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512874e64c60-ctgr-73030764341727849', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The 5-axis combi riser from Quick•Point® Rail can be mounted on the clamping bars of the quick clamping system with absolute flexibility and positioning accuracy. Thanks to the dovetail guide and the pull-down principle, the interface between the clamping bar and the riser is extremely stable and resilient - a guarantee for reliable and consistent milling quality. With the two zero point grids - 52 and 96 mm - all vise versions from LANG can be clamped without any problems. The overall height of 100 mm makes this riser ideal for 5-axis machining, where good accessibility is required.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976671286530583812b8c73487.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 244, '2023-10-18 22:12:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530595cbe781-prod-41035186461092254', 'Quick•Point® Rail 52/96, 5-Axis Combi Riser', '73486-lang-quickpoint-rail-5296-5-axis-combi-riser', '73486', '1', '65115ed015bd9-ctgr-97049127326775050', '6512874e64c60-ctgr-73030764341727849', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Quick•Point® Rail 5-axis combi riser can be flexibly positioned on the clamping and extension bars of the quick clamping system and fixed at 4 mm intervals. Thanks to the dovetail guide and pull-down effect, the quick clamping system impresses with maximum stability and load capacity. The 5-axis combi riser offers both the 52 mm and the 96 mm zero point grid on its upper side, which means that any vise model from LANG can be clamped in it.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976674206530595cbe45373486.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 245, '2023-10-18 22:17:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530bdf6776b2-prod-52124763251970254', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit', '41140-he-lang-makrogrip-stamping-unit', '41140-HE', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abea406bf-ctgr-81427340654841132', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The extended, additional stamping unit with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and High-End stamping jaws up to 45 HRC material hardness is used to convert a single stamping unit into a dual-stamping unit. The scope of delivery for the additional stamping unit, which is supplied without the pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier, includes the mounting material for the additional stamping unit.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976931746530bdf6770df41140-HE[1].webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 33, '2023-10-19 05:26:14', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530bf016d629-prod-96259418940811676', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit', '41140-lang-makrogrip-stamping-unit', '41140', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512abea406bf-ctgr-81427340654841132', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The extended, additional stamping unit with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and standard stamping jaws up to 35 HRC material hardness is used to convert a single stamping unit into a dual-stamping unit. The scope of delivery for the additional stamping unit, which is supplied without the pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier, includes the mounting material for the additional stamping unit.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976934416530bf016c54f41140[1].png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34, '2023-10-19 05:30:41', '2024-05-17 20:40:57', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530c12bea87c-prod-10172395803181663', 'Makro•Grip® 77, Contour Jaws', '48419-77-lang-makrogrip-77-contour-jaws', '48419-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acf34a86d-ctgr-29705123223230177', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the outside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the large clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976939956530c12be9eb848419-77.webp', '[\"16976939956530c12bea14148419-77_Seite_1.webp\",\"16976939956530c12bea30f48200-77_TG_48409-77_48419-77.webp\",\"16976939956530c12bea61248160-77_48419-77.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18, '2023-10-19 05:39:55', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530c2e02008f-prod-17888163518210527', 'Makro•Grip® 125, Contour Jaws', '48419-125-lang-makrogrip-125-contour-jaws', '48419-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acf34a86d-ctgr-29705123223230177', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the outside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the large clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16976944326530c2e01f5ac48419-125[1].webp', '[\"16976944326530c2e01f96648419-125_Seite_1_0.webp\",\"16976944326530c2e01fad048255-125_TG_48409-125_48419-125.webp\",\"16976944326530c2e01fdb848255-125_48419-125.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 19, '2023-10-19 05:47:12', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6530d8d58fbc7-prod-20615453427683769', 'Makro•Grip® micro 46, 5-Axis Vise Jaw width 46 mm, Clamping range 0 - 65 mm', '48040-46-lang-makrogrip-micro-46-5-axis-vise-jaw-width-46-mm-clamping-range-0-65-mm', '48040-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512712c4e784-ctgr-93277571660062513', NULL, 0, 0, '<p>Rarely has \"small but mighty\" been so appropriate as with the new Makro•Grip® 46 micro. The 5-Axis Vise with jaw width 46 mm and clamping range up to a maximum of 65 mm is ideally suited for machining small components where space is limited. Its special feature is on the underside of the vise. Instead of four clamping studs, only two clamping studs are installed in this version. This makes it possible to clamp two of these vises in one Quick•Point® 52 zero point plate. Likewise, the new micro vise can be used on the matching Quick•Point® duo series - either alone or side by side, depending on the type of the plate.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16977000536530d8d58f87348040-46.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, 'Machine Tools Solution', '<p><br></p>', NULL, 90, '2023-10-19 07:20:53', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('653f7adf75e4a-prod-79409219246950132', 'MFR-A1-050', 'mfr-a1-050-spd-mfr-a1-050', 'MFR-A1-050', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING ON MEDIUM-LOW THICKNESS PIECES</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It is the most versatile magnetic chuck in the range. Generating force on&nbsp;few millimetres, it enables small and medium-sized workpieces with reduced thicknesses to be processed.&nbsp;The&nbsp;dense&nbsp;pole pitch allows effective adaptation to a wide range of designs.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It can be used with fixed and mobile extensions, for processing on 5-axis machines, with both unfinished and finished work-pieces.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698659039653f7adf75b62MFR-A1-050-040-060-1.png', '[\"1698660393653f802909f86oo.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 273, '2023-10-30 16:43:59', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('653fd885a9071-prod-54809401486668697', 'MFS-A1-050', 'mfs-a1-050-spd-mfs-a1-050', 'MFS-A1-050', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK WITH SQUARE POLE LAYOUT, WITH FULL STEEL CLAMPING SURFACE, DESIGNED FOR HARSH MACHINING OPERATIONS AND AGGRESSIVE ENVIRONMENTS.</h4><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div></h2>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698683013653fd885a8d31SPD-MFS-a1-050-040-060-1.png', '[\"1698683013653fd885a8f13DISEGNO-MFS-A1-050-040-060.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 274, '2023-10-30 23:23:33', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('653fe22f47c89-prod-77704945706988843', 'MFRR-A1-050', 'mfrr-a1-050-spd-mfrr-a1-050', 'MFRR-A1-050', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">CIRCULAR ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING OF SMALL AND MEDIUM SIZED WORK-PIECES WITH MEDIUM-LOW THICKNESS, SUITABLE FOR ROUND-TABLE MACHINES.</h4></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698685487653fe22f4793bMFRR-A1-050-3.png', '[\"1698685487653fe22f47afcDisegno-MFRR-A1-050-Copia.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 275, '2023-10-31 00:04:47', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65400bc99da6f-prod-31488959310761006', 'MFR-A2-050', 'mfr-a2-050-spd-mfr-a2-050', 'MFR-A2-050', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR HIGH VOLUME MILLING USING POLE EXTENSIONS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">This is the most powerful model in the MFR series. It has a great magnetic force expressed specifically when work is carried out with pole extensions and unfinished work-pieces.<br>It is preferred to the A1 model in complex roughing applications on pole extensions of alloyed materials.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169869613765400bc99d6efMFR-A2-050-040-060-1.png', '[\"169869613765400bc99d911IMG-MFR-A2-050-040-060.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 276, '2023-10-31 03:02:17', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6540d59b16bcb-prod-42671162766688953', 'MFR-A1-070', 'mfr-a1-070-spd-mfr-a1-070', 'MFR-A1-070', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING OF PIECES WITH MEDIUM-HIGH THICKNESS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It’s the basic version of pole 70. Suitable for any type of work on medium and large size work-pieces, with unfinished or finished surface. Recommended for laminated materials. Ideal for composite solutions to cover large machine tables.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16987478036540d59b16860MFR-A1-070-040-060-1.png', '[\"16987478036540d59b16a68IMG-MFR-A1-070-040-060.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 277, '2023-10-31 17:23:23', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6540fa5f9dd30-prod-62873844272227219', 'MFR-A2-070', 'mfr-a2-070-spd-mfr-a2-070', 'MFR-A2-070', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR LARGE REMOVALS ON ANY TYPE OF MATERIAL WITH THE USE OF POLE EXTENSIONS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It is the most powerful magnetic chuck on the market. A great magnetic force allows it to clamp pieces with high air gaps and to handle large removals. With the help of flexible and fixed extensions, it is ideal for processing highly deformed workpieces such as cast iron, forged parts, high-alloy mould steels. Recommended for processing squared work-pieces.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16987572156540fa5f9d99aMFR-A2-070-040-060-1.png', '[\"16987572156540fa5f9dbafIMG-MFR-A2-070-040-060.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 278, '2023-10-31 20:00:15', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6541073530ebc-prod-86686721359239656', 'MFR-A1-032', 'mfr-a1-032-spd-mfr-a1-032', 'MFR-A1-032', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING OF THIN-WALLED WORK-PIECES.</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Magnetic chuck specifically recommended for non-heavy milling operations on small or thin pieces. The high grip in&nbsp;the first millimetres of the work-piece is the strength of the unique product on our market. Recommended for high speed machining centres</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16987605016541073530ab5MFR-A1-032-040-060-1 (1).png', '[\"1698763258654111fa79a3aIMG-MFR-A1-032-060-040 (2).png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 279, '2023-10-31 20:55:01', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654112a0b4b30-prod-96866667179472294', 'MFP-A1-L30', 'mfp-a1-l30-spd-mfp-a1-l30', 'MFP-A1-L30', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING ON MEDIUM-LOW THICKNESS WORK-PIECES WITH IRREGULAR OUTLINE</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">This is the classic parallel pole chuck for milling applications, optimised for maximum versatility, specific strength and a wide choice of pole extensions (fixed, flexible, upper plates). It gives its best with medium-low thickness work-pieces, of complex and irregular outline, thanks to the ease in obtaining the correct balance of North and South polarity.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698763424654112a0b4813SPD-MFP-A1-L30-040-060-1-1.png', '[\"1698763424654112a0b49faDisegno-MFP-A1-L30.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 280, '2023-10-31 21:43:44', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654134e8ce6e9-prod-64469199023266583', 'MFP-A1-L08', 'mfp-a1-l08-spd-mfp-a1-l08', 'MFP-A1-L08', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6165025b3-ctgr-74839821220729217', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR REMOVAL THROUGH MILLING OF SMALL AND THIN-WALLED WORK-PIECES.</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It is the only real solution on the market for milling small and thin parts, where other electro-permanent solutions show their limitations. The very fine pitch allows optimal flux control on low thicknesses, thus ensuring the best possible clamping force and the elimination of problems related to chip evacuation. The all-metal clamping surface provides stability, precision and durability; the top/upper plate is also replaceable, allowing easy repairs in case of accidental damage or special needs.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698772200654134e8ce2a7MFP-L08-senza-sovrapiastra_light.png', '[\"1698772200654134e8ce596Disegno-MFP-A1-L08.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 281, '2023-11-01 00:10:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65413b83ca6ec-prod-18011637682920283', 'PM60A', 'pm60a-spd-pm60a', 'PM60A', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR GRINDING OPERATIONS FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL DEMAG CYCLE AND STANDARD POLE PITCH WITH IRON AND RESIN STRUCTURE.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Recommended for medium-sized work-pieces with normal thickness (over 10 mm) suitable for common machining.<br>Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 4mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169877389165413b83ca3fdPM60.A-1.png', '[\"169877389165413b83ca5ccPM60.A-DISEGNO.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 282, '2023-11-01 00:38:11', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6541491ea2c22-prod-33120447402395438', 'MTR', 'mtr-spd-mtr', 'MTR', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b62022b28e-ctgr-90913975238652323', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">RADIAL CHUCK FOR HEAVY TURNING</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Electropermanent chuck for high removal rates and/or high productivity in terms of work-pieces per hour, with ALNICo structure plus additional Neodymium magnets, allowing a polarity reversal in a fraction of a second. Suitable for clamping forged work-pieces with rough or deformed clamping surfaces.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16987773746541491ea281bMTR.png', '[\"169877768765414a57df335MTR-MGT-1.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 288, '2023-11-01 01:36:14', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65414ed585d9a-prod-91253562941972086', 'PM60D', 'pm60d-spd-pm60d', 'PM60D', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTROPERMANENT CHUCK FOR GRINDING OPERATIONS FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL DEMAG CYCLE AND FINE POLE PITCH WITH IRON AND BRASS STRUCTURE.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It represents the specific solution for thin-walled work-pieces (over 7 mm) and precision machining.&nbsp;Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 3mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169877883765414ed585aa5PM60.D-1.png', '[\"169877883765414ed585c6aPM60.D-DISEGNO.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 283, '2023-11-01 02:00:37', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6541514c5f3c9-prod-52865434056463323', 'MGT', 'mgt-spd-mgt', 'MGT', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b62022b28e-ctgr-90913975238652323', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">RADIAL CHUCK FOR GENERAL TURNING OPERATIONS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Electro-permanent chuck for medium and fine finishing operations on all types of carbon or alloy steels, tempered and hardened, with direct clamping or with intermediate pole extensions. They have a double alnico structure with no&nbsp;remenance after the demagnetisation cycle.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16987794686541514c5efedmgt-1.png', '[\"16987794686541514c5f1d8MTR-MGT.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 289, '2023-11-01 02:11:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654220a96c94d-prod-96081766053213405', 'PM62', 'pm62-spd-pm62', 'PM62', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTROPERMANENT CHUCK FOR GRINDING OPERATIONS&nbsp;FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL<br>DEMAG CYCLE AND AN ADDITIONAL UPPER PLATE OUT OF IRON AND BRASS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The outstanding quality of this model lies in the upper plate, which is fixed on the magnetic chuck to ensure maximum rigidity. It is mainly used for high precision grinding and is able to&nbsp;clamp&nbsp;extremely well even very thin pieces thanks to&nbsp;its dense pole pitch ( over 5 mm).&nbsp;Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 2mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698832553654220a96c5faPM62-1.png', '[\"1698832553654220a96c822PM62-disegno.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 284, '2023-11-01 16:55:53', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540');
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `code`, `brand_id`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `price`, `show_price`, `show_price_to_partner`, `key_features`, `further_information`, `discount_type`, `discount`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `status`, `features`, `meta_title`, `meta_tags`, `meta_descriptions`, `ancestor_id`, `short_number`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `company_id`) VALUES
('65422385acccc-prod-65413958975977763', 'PM80A', 'pm80a-spd-pm80a', 'PM80A', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">CLOSED-POLE ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR CIRCULAR GRINDING,&nbsp;FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL DEMAG CYCLE AND&nbsp;POLE PITCH WITH IRON AND RESIN STRUCTURE.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Recommended for medium-sized workpieces with&nbsp;normal thickness (over 10 mm) suitable for circular machines.&nbsp;Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 4mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169883328565422385ac91dPM80A-2.png', '[\"169883328565422385acb32PM80.A-DISEGNO-1.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 285, '2023-11-01 17:08:05', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65422513dc638-prod-15874018590471910', 'PM81D', 'pm81d-spd-pm81d', 'PM81D', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">OPEN-POLE ELECTRO-PERMANENT CHUCK FOR CIRCULAR GRINDING&nbsp;FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL DEMAG CYCLE AND&nbsp;POLE PITCH WITH IRON AND RESIN STRUCTURE.</h4><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">It represents the specific solution for thin-walled work-pieces (over 7 mm) and precision circular machining.&nbsp;Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 3mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm.</p></div></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169883368365422513dc30ePM81D-1.png', '[\"169883368365422513dc4edPM81.d-DISEGNO.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 286, '2023-11-01 17:14:43', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65422e73ce209-prod-86103364221496752', 'PM82', 'pm82-spd-pm82', 'PM82', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b61c95f8eb-ctgr-85991730819245178', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTROPERMANENT CHUCK FOR CIRCULAR GRINDING OPERATIONS&nbsp;FEATURING A NO RESIDUAL DEMAG CYCLE AND AN ADDITIONAL UPPER PLATE OUT OF IRON AND BRASS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The outstanding quality of this model lies in the upper plate, which is fixed on the magnetic chuck to ensure stability. It is mainly used for high precision grinding and is able to clamp&nbsp;extremely well even very thin pieces thanks to&nbsp;dense pole pitch<br>(over 5 mm) on circular machines.&nbsp;Not suitable for the machining of workpieces with thickness inferior to 2mm and dimensions smaller than 50x 50mm.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169883608365422e73cdca7pm82-1.png', '[\"169883608365422e73cdff2pm82-DISEGNO.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 287, '2023-11-01 17:54:43', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654234dc22d22-prod-94764033219215013', 'MEF-Q', 'mef-q-spd-mef-q', 'MEF-Q', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6f655628d-ctgr-21259241783725808', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT MAGNETIC MODULES FOR WIRE EDM WITH DETACHABLE CONNECTION</span><br></h2>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698837724654234dc22980MEF-100Q-45-s-1.png', '[\"1698837724654234dc22b7aTAVOLA-DIMENSIONI-MEF-45Q.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 290, '2023-11-01 18:22:04', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654235dfd5f02-prod-76605686656318576', 'MEF-F', 'mef-f-spd-mef-f', 'MEF-F', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6f655628d-ctgr-21259241783725808', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT MAGNETIC MODULES FOR WIRE EDM WITH FIXED CONNECTION.</span><br></h2>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698837983654235dfd5bb2MEF-100F-45-s-1.png', '[\"1698837983654235dfd5d99TAVOLA-DIMENSIONI-MEF-45F.png\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 291, '2023-11-01 18:26:23', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542372a2c56e-prod-84599518905863089', 'PM91', 'pm91-spd-pm91', 'PM91', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328299b15dd-ctgr-27302527109501547', '653b6f655628d-ctgr-21259241783725808', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT MAGNETIC MODULES FOR SINKER EDM WITH FIXED CONNECTION</h4></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988383146542372a2c347PM91.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 292, '2023-11-01 18:31:54', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654246251af3f-prod-39599779588089908', 'MHM-IT', 'mhm-it-spd-mhm-it', 'MHM-IT', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">MAGNETIC NEODYMIUM LEVER LIFTERS SUITABLE FOR HANDLING BOTH FLAT AND ROUND FERROUS LOADS</h4><h3 class=\"productDetails_title\" style=\"\">ADVANTAGES OVER CONVENTIONAL SYSTEMS:&nbsp;<br style=\"\">•&nbsp;Reduced leadtime during both loading and unloading of the&nbsp;work-piece;<br style=\"\">• Increased safety: no more risky slinging operations required;<br style=\"\">• Easily accessible and better exploitable work-piece surface;<br style=\"\">• Increased gripping versatility in case of pieces with different shapes and sizes or with uneven surfaces or in case of small loose pieces;<br style=\"\">• No deformation and/or damage to the work-piece caused by mechanical clamping.</h3><h3 class=\"productDetails_title\" style=\"\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">TECHNICAL FEATURES:<br>SAFETY<br>The safety coefficient 3:1, required by current legal standards, has been deliberately increased by 10-15% to ensure a high level of reliability over a long period of time.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">STURDINESS<br>The dimensions of each component have been correctly calibrated to ensure a high resistance to wear over time. Especially the Mag and Demag lever has been designed to withstand accidental impacts during free positioning of the lifting magnet. The sturdiness and interchangeability of all removable components (from the lifting hook to the containment plates and the cam guide of the lever) guarantee minimum maintenance costs.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">COMPACTNESS<br>A lightweight, space-saving hook, integrated directly inside the cam guiding the lever stroke, can be used in confined spaces and on cranes with limited capacity.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">RELIABILTY<br>The production process includes the homogeneous polarisation of the magnets only after the lifting magnet has been fully assembled, in order to create a perfectly balanced field on the inside. The production cycle is completed by the final testing, performed on each lifting magnet and guaranteed by the attached certificate.<br><a href=\"http://www.spd.it/wp-content/uploads/TEST-COLLAUDO-1.pdf\" style=\"transition: color 0.2s ease 0s;\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to download the facsimile of the acceptance testing.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">HANDY AND VERSATILE<br>Thanks to the front hook which can be swivelled by 360° at its base, and to the bell which can be tilted by 180°, clamping operations even under the most uncomfortable and inaccessible conditions are made possible. The combination of the upper and front-mounted hook provides a single solution for any horizontal and vertical lifting needs.</p><br></h3><div><br></div></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698842149654246251ad58RENDER-MHM-IT-125-1.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 293, '2023-11-01 19:35:49', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542500bdec75-prod-10232331723185628', 'MHM-V', 'mhm-v-spd-mhm-v', 'MHM-V', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">NEODYMIUM MAGNETIC LEVER LIFTERS FOR HORIZONTAL AND VERTICAL LIFTING</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">ADVANTAGES OVER CONVENTIONAL SYSTEMS:&nbsp;<br>•&nbsp;Reduced leadtime during both loading and unloading of the&nbsp;work-piece;<br>• Increased safety: no more risky slinging operations required;<br>• Easily accessible and better exploitable work-piece surface;<br>• Increased gripping versatility in case of pieces with different shapes and sizes or with uneven surfaces or in case of small loose pieces;<br>• No deformation and/or damage to the work-piece caused by mechanical clamping.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">TECHNICAL FEATURES:<br>SAFETY<br>The safety coefficient 3:1, required by current legal standards, has been deliberately increased by 10-15% to ensure a high level of reliability over a long period of time.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">STURDINESS<br>The dimensions of each component have been correctly calibrated to ensure a high resistance to wear over time. Especially the Mag and Demag lever has been designed to withstand accidental impacts during free positioning of the lifting magnet. The sturdiness and interchangeability of all removable components (from the lifting hook to the containment plates and the cam guide of the lever) guarantee minimum maintenance costs.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">COMPACTNESS<br>A lightweight, space-saving hook, integrated directly inside the cam guiding the lever stroke, can be used in confined spaces and on cranes with limited capacity.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">RELIABILTY<br>The production process includes the homogeneous polarisation of the magnets only after the lifting magnet has been fully assembled, in order to create a perfectly balanced field on the inside. The production cycle is completed by the final testing, performed on each lifting magnet and guaranteed by the attached certificate.<br><a href=\"http://www.spd.it/wp-content/uploads/TEST-COLLAUDO-1.pdf\" style=\"transition: color 0.2s ease 0s;\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to download the facsimile of the acceptance testing.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">HANDY AND VERSATILE<br>Thanks to the front hook which can be swivelled by 360° at its base, and to the bell which can be tilted by 180°, clamping operations even under the most uncomfortable and inaccessible conditions are made possible. The combination of the upper and front-mounted hook provides a single solution for any horizontal and vertical lifting needs.</p></div>', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\"><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988446836542500bdeaccMHM-V-50.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 294, '2023-11-01 20:18:03', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542521a0ea1d-prod-63781700543975247', 'MHV', 'mhv-spd-mhv', 'MHV', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">EQUIPMENT DESIGNED FOR THE MANUAL TILTING OF PLATES. THE VALUE STATED ON THE PRODUCT IS THE MAXIMUM USABLE FORCE WITH THE WORK-PIECE IN THE VERTICAL POSITION</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">ADVANTAGES OVER CONVENTIONAL SYSTEMS:</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">•&nbsp;Reduced leadtime during both loading and unloading of the work-piece;<br>• Increased safety: no more risky slinging operations required;<br>• Easily accessible and better exploitable work-piece surface;<br>• Increased gripping versatility in case of pieces with different shapes and sizes or with uneven surfaces or in case of small loose pieces<br>• No deformation and/or damage to the work-piece caused by mechanical clamping.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">TECHNICAL FEATURES:<br>SAFETY<br>The safety coefficient 3:1, required by current legal standards, has been deliberately increased by 10-15% to ensure a high level of reliability over a long period of time.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">RELIABILITY<br>The outer support of the structure keeps the lifting force unaltered, thus ensuring a more stable, compact and never deformed load while being shifted.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">EFFICIENCY<br>Gripping, tilting, handling and release can be carried out dynamically by a single operator. No additional personnel are required for securing or fastening the load.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">VERSATILITY<br>It is easily adjustable to work-pieces of different sizes and weights, thanks to its multiple positioning holes provided on the magnetic module, as well as to the freely rotatable lifting bell.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988452106542521a0e891MHV-200.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 295, '2023-11-01 20:26:50', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('654253a90e8eb-prod-97128175600611983', 'MHT', 'mht-spd-mht', 'MHT', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '65fb20c05c3dc-ctgr-77975129729235883', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">FIXED BEAMS FOR MANUAL LIFTERS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Equipment that can be combined with the manually operated magnetic lifters MHM-IT, for handling pieces larger than the standard size. These userfriendly, sturdy and durable beams have been designed to meet a wide range of customer needs.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">We manufacture tailor-made equipment on request.<br style=\"\">Example of tailor-made equipment.<br></p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1698845609654253a90e743MHT-1000.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 317, '2023-11-01 20:33:29', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425524c5439-prod-46949688828709301', 'SEL', 'sel-spd-sel', 'SEL', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT LIFTERS FOR (HOT ROLLED) SHEET METAL OR COILS WITH LOW AIR GAP OR PRE-MACHINED BLOCKS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The SEL lifters have been designed for handling sheet metals of various thicknesses, or pre-machined blocks. Suitable for lifting work-pieces with low air gaps. They feature a remote control, allowing a single operator to carry out all types of operations (clamping, lifting, shifting, release).</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">EASY SERIES: more compact and light version for Handling operations, using immediately the FULL-MAG configuration for a fast performance.<br></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">STANDARD SERIES:&nbsp;uses the PICK UP and FULL MAG magnetization system. PICK-UP: by means of the partial magnetisation power (75%) the load can be lifted a few centimetres from the gorund to verify whether it has been correctly clamped. Once successfully checked, the operator can magnetize the lifter by using the FULL-MAG power option prior to carrying out the required handling operations.<br></p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884598865425524c5240SEL-LINEA-EASY-1.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 296, '2023-11-01 20:39:48', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542582f3fe28-prod-79335546505761679', 'SB01', 'sb01-spd-sb01', 'SB01', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">BATTERY-POWERED ELECTRO-PERMANENT MAGNETIC LIFTERS FOR LIFTING BOTH FLAT AND ROUND WORKPIECES WITH A MINIMUM THICKNESS OF 40mm</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Lifter series designed to hoist both flat and round workpieces in total safety. Extremely versatile as no electrical connection is required except for its recharging. Thanks to their standard supplied battery, they can perform about 250 – 300 magnetisation and demagnetisation operations. The battery energy is only used during MAG/DEMAG cycles for about 1 second. It features furthermore a remote control allowing the operator to control operations within a 10-metre radius.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988467676542582f3fc7fRENDER-1.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 297, '2023-11-01 20:52:47', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425945781a6-prod-38463155178254643', 'SPEEDY BAT', 'speedy-bat-spd-speedy-bat', 'SPEEDY BAT', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72a5e3b69-ctgr-75590552040595187', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">BATTERY-POWERED ELECTROPERMANENT MAGNETIC LIFTERS FOR LIFTING AND HANDLING FERROUS LOADS OF VARIOUS SHAPES AND SIZES</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">No electrical connection is required except during charging. Thanks to the force of the permanent magnets the load remains firmly clamped even in absence of power supply. A magnetic sensor prevents the demagnetization command from being activated whenever the load is suspended. This operation can only be performed when the load is placed on a stable surface. It is equipped with a remote control to&nbsp;activate the Mag and Demag of the lifting magnet at a safe distance or to operate in environments with limited accessibility. More than 1,500 loading/unloading operations without battery recharge.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988470456542594577f24Speedy-Bat_Fronte.gif', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 298, '2023-11-01 20:57:25', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425a0b0e8c3-prod-94080190047571830', 'TRETEL', 'tretel-spd-tretel', 'TRETEL', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT TELESCOPIC BEAM FOR LIFTING LARGE SHEET METALS OF ANY THICKNESS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The electro-permanent telescopic beams of the TRETEL series have been designed to handle large sheet metals of any thickness, lifting the load from above without deformation or damage. The load remains clamped indefinitely with a constant force, limiting the energy consumption to the magnetic activation or deactivation cycles. They do not require the installation of buffer batteries, feature an “antiaccidental deactivation” system and extendible arms controlled by a hydraulic pump, and offer as well the possibility of selecting the modules to be magnetized according to the size of the load. Thanks to the provided<br>remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all the operations while remaining at a safe distance from the load.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884724365425a0b0e708001_TRETEL-408.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 306, '2023-11-01 21:00:43', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425c5db5286-prod-47132739506663697', 'TREFIX', 'trefix-spd-trefix', 'TREFIX', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT RIGID BEAM FOR LIFTING LARGE SHEET METALS OF ANY THICKNESS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The electro-permanent rigid beams of the Trefix series have been designed to handle large sheet metals of any predefined thickness and length with no need of telescopic movements, lifting the load from above without deformation or damage. The load remains clamped indefinitely with a constant force, limiting the energy consumption to the magnetic activation or deactivation cycles. They do not require the installation of buffer batteries, feature an “anti-accidental deactivation” system, and offer as well the possibility of selecting the modules to be magnetized according to the size of the load. Thanks to the provided remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all the operations while remaining at a safe distance from the load.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884783765425c5db50f4wMQ3z_JA.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 307, '2023-11-01 21:10:37', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425e2ac1714-prod-27898625240916000', 'COILS HANDLING', 'coils-handling-spd-coils-handling', 'COILS HANDLING', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b73375675b-ctgr-24788981022086549', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">HANDLING SOLUTIONS FOR COMPACT COILS OF ANY WEIGHT AND SIZES</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">They offer the advantage of not deforming and damaging the load, reducing at the same time the operating space as the module is always positioned from above. Suitable for coils with both horizontal and vertical axis.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884829865425e2ac1524IMG_4837-1.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 312, '2023-11-01 21:18:18', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425ec609765-prod-94504433435717552', 'SLABS HANDLING', 'slabs-handling-spd-slabs-handling', 'SLABS HANDLING', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b73375675b-ctgr-24788981022086549', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">SOLUTION SLABS HANDLING OF ANY WEIGHT AND SIZES</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">Suitable for overhead or selfpropelled cranes. They are mounted on port cranes and facilitate the unloading of slabs from the cargo hold.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884845465425ec609520Bramme-057-1.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 313, '2023-11-01 21:20:54', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425f5b5031e-prod-65369698323470303', 'TUBES HANDLING', 'tubes-handling-spd-tubes-handling', 'TUBES HANDLING', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b73375675b-ctgr-24788981022086549', NULL, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">HANDLING SOLUTIONS FOR TUBES OF ANY WEIGHT AND SIZES</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">They offer the advantage of not deforming and damaging the load, reducing at the same time the operating space as the module is always positioned from above. Suitable. They provide complete safety as they can be controlled remotely by a single operator. These modules can be integrated into large lifting systems controlled either by PLC or manually from the control panel of the main equipment.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884860365425f5b50087IMG_5968.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 314, '2023-11-01 21:23:23', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65425fd88e556-prod-32891212815580941', 'BEAMS AND PROFILES HANDLING', 'beams-and-profiles-handling-spd-beams-and-profiles-handling', 'BEAMS AND PROFILES HANDLING', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b73375675b-ctgr-24788981022086549', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">SOLUTIONS FOR BEAMS AND PROFILES OF ANY WEIGHT AND SIZES</span><br></h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">They combine the advantages of safe lifting with compactness and functionality. The shaped profile allows the beam to be tilted on the ground and to be easily stored in warehouses or on vehicles. The polar conformation has been designed and adapted to the shape of the piece to increase the contact surface, thus improving both force and controllability of the system.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169884872865425fd88e30e055-1.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 315, '2023-11-01 21:25:28', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542608377f53-prod-37591832885918272', 'RING HANDLING', 'ring-handling-spd-ring-handling', 'RING HANDLING', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b73375675b-ctgr-24788981022086549', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT SOLUTIONS FOR RINGS OF ANY WEIGHT AND SIZES</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">These modules can be integrated into more complex automatic or manual systems, which can in this way use and control the magnetic part supplied by SPD at best to obtain the desired clamping and shifting results They offer the advantage of not deforming and damaging the load, reducing at the same time the operating space as the module is Always positioned from above. They provide complete safety as they can be controlled remotely by a PLC or by a single operator. The modules are furthermore extremely versatile, because it is possible to lift a wide range of weights and diameters by means of a single module size without having to change each time their position.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988488996542608377d26IMG_7006.jpg', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 316, '2023-11-01 21:28:19', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542657425f35-prod-94314299658833049', 'TREFIX-V', 'trefix-v-spd-trefix-v', 'TREFIX-V', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; color: rgb(27, 31, 32); margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 24px; padding-left: 50px; font-family: Oswald, sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; text-transform: uppercase !important;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px; font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; color: rgb(27, 31, 32); margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Oswald, sans-serif !important;\">RIGID ELECTRO-PERMANENT TILTING BEAM FOR VERTICAL AND HORIZONTAL LIFTING OF SHEET METALS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px;\">The electro-permanent beams of the Trefix-V series have been designed to handle large sheet metals of any predefined thickness and length with no need of telescopic movements. Suitable for warehouses with metal rack storage systems. The load is lifted from above without deformation or damage, and remains clamped indefinitely with a constant force, limiting the energy consumption to the magnetic activation or deactivation cycles. They do not require the installation of buffer batteries, feature an “anti-accidental deactivation” system, and offer as well the possibility of selecting the modules to be magnetized according to the size of the load. Thanks to the provided remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all the operations while remaining at a safe distance from the load.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988501646542657425d81trefix-v-1.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 308, '2023-11-01 21:49:24', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6542661887222-prod-31006578411772700', 'TREFIX-T', 'trefix-t-spd-trefix-t', 'TREFIX-T', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">RIGID ELECTRO-PERMANENT BEAM FOR UNLOADING ON CUTTING MACHINES.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The rigid electro-permanent beams of the TREFIX-T series have been designed to load and unload sheet metals of specific dimensions onto cutting machines (laser, oxycutting, plasma). Once the sheet metal has been cut, the beam is able to unload it from the machine along with the chips with a single clamping operation, making the machine immediately available for the next sheet metal. The load is lifted from above without deformation or damage, and remains clamped indefinitely with a constant force, limiting the energy consumption to the magnetic activation or deactivationcycles. They do not require the installation of buffer batteries, feature an “anti-accidental deactivation” system, and offer as well the possibility of selecting the modules to be magnetized according to the size of the load. Thanks to the provided remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all the operations while remaining at a safe distance from the load.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '16988503286542661886fb4TREFIX-T-3.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 309, '2023-11-01 21:52:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65426693ef2b1-prod-65945048448028583', 'SEP-R', 'sep-r-spd-sep-r', 'SEP-R', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT LIFTER FOR ROUND BARS.</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">The SEP-R modules have been designed to handle round, forged parts with high air gaps Thanks to their well-structured design, they are suitable for high stresses and therefore reliable over time. By means of the provided remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all types of operations (clamping, lifting, shifting, release). A mechanical “V” centring device, on the other hand, ensures a quick and easy the work-piece centring operation.</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169885045165426693ef0edSEP-R-1.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 310, '2023-11-01 21:54:11', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65429f724b06b-prod-84009433519422779', 'SEP', 'sep-spd-sep', 'SEP', '653b407814c5d-brnd-30399065672704514', '65328471c311f-ctgr-62324388771040640', '653b72cb19478-ctgr-63035080109942588', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h2 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 50px;\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h2><div class=\"testo\" style=\"padding-left: 50px;\"><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 11.5px; margin-bottom: 11.5px;\">ELECTRO-PERMANENT LIFTER FOR SHEET METAL, SLABS, FORGED BLOCKS WITH HIGH AIR GAPS</h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">SEP modules have been designed to handle sheet metals, slabs and forged blocks with high air gaps. Thanks to their well-structured design, they are suitable for high stresses and therefore reliable over time. By means of the provided remote control, a single operator is able to carry out all types of operations (clamping, lifting, shifting, release).</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11.5px; margin-left: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></div>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '169886501065429f724ae58SEP-HM51-1.png', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 311, '2023-11-02 01:56:50', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('655ca0ab13e24-prod-80171518041265610', 'Makro•Grip® 46, 5-Axis Vise jaw width 46 mm, clamping range 0 - 65 mm', '47065-lang-makrogrip-46-5-axis-vise-jaw-width-46-mm-clamping-range-0-65-mm', '47065', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512712c4e784-ctgr-93277571660062513', NULL, 0, 0, '<p>The popular Makro•Grip® 46 is available again. The smallest version among the 5-axis vises with a jaw width of 46 mm is designed for workpieces with a clamping range of up to 65 mm. Its compact design and minimal interference contours make it ideal for 5-sided machining of unmachined parts. With its base of only 77 x 77, the 5-axis vise does not protrude even on the smallest zero-point plates and is therefore popular for use on multiple clamping fixtures.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1700569259655ca0ab138d847065.webp', '[\"1700569259655ca0ab13b3b47065_Seite_2.webp\",\"1700569259655ca0ab13c8847065_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, '', '<p><br></p>', NULL, 91, '2023-11-21 19:20:59', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65606a91e00b1-prod-67493359807531848', 'Makro•Grip® 46, 5-Axis Vise', '48065-46-lang-makrogrip-46-5-axis-vise', '48065-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The new Makro•Grip® 46 is the successor version of the popular, small 5-Axis Vise from LANG Technik (item no. 47065). With its compact base body, it is ideally suited for workpiece clamping of small components, for example from medical technology. The 5-Axis Vise proves to be extremely practical due to its small footprint of just 77 x 77 mm. Even with the smallest zero point plates, this vise does not protrude, which makes it particularly predestined for multiple part clamping.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170081755365606a91dfe8548065-46.webp', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-11-24 16:19:13', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65607af542013-prod-39527410409424012', 'Makro•Grip® 77, HAUBEX 5-Axis Vise', '61085-46-lang-makrogrip-77-haubex-5-axis-vise-2', '61085-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>HAUBEX uses a modified version of the Makro•Grip® as the workholding device. The slim design of the 5-Axis Vice and the narrow jaw width of 46 mm ensure ideal accessibility in 5-sided machining of blanks. The maximum workpiece size of approx. 80 × 75 × 70 mm is given by the height and diameter of the workholding hood. Examples of possible dimensions and a formula for their calculation can be found on the data sheet in the downloads.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170082174965607af541b8e61085-46.webp', '[\"170082174965607af541d9b61085-46_Seite_2.webp\",\"170082174965607af541ecf61085-46_Seite_1.webp\"]', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9, '2023-11-24 17:29:09', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65608fbe81a6d-prod-74589494611512752', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise, jaw width 125 mm, clamping range 0 - 355 mm', '48355-125-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise-jaw-width-125-mm-clamping-range-0-355-mm', '48355-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>With a clamping range of 355 mm, this 5-Axis Vise is the largest among the Makro•Grip® vises. Its base body has a length of 360 mm, the jaw width is 125 mm. Due to its sturdiness and holding forces, the 5-Axis Vise is able to clamp workpieces that significantly exceed its volume. The form fit between the clamping jaws and the workpiece ensures maximum safety in the clamping process. Even with high tensile material, the required clamping pressure is low. This prevents wear on the clamping device and material deformation during machining.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170082707065608fbe813e748355-125[1]_0.webp', '[\"170082707065608fbe8175048355-125_Seite_2.webp\",\"170082707065608fbe818f848355-125_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17, '2023-11-24 18:57:50', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6560918bb1d73-prod-65993314387700939', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise, jaw width 125 mm, clamping range 0 - 305 mm', '48305-125-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise-jaw-width-125-mm-clamping-range-0-305-mm', '48305-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise with jaw width 125 mm is mainly used for clamping larger workpieces. With its 310 mm long base body, it has a clamping range of up to 305 mm, which means that the centrically clamped workpiece is ideally accessible for the tools used. This allows the use of short tools and results in less vibration as well as longer tool life. At the same time, higher cutting rates can be applied, which reduces machining times and costs.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '17008275316560918bb156b48305-125[1]_0.webp', '[\"17008275316560918bb19a648305-125_Seite_2.webp\",\"17008275316560918bb1b2548305-125_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16, '2023-11-24 19:05:31', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656095286ae83-prod-46194702022146119', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise, jaw width 125 mm, clamping range 0 - 255 mm', '48255-125-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise-jaw-width-125-mm-clamping-range-0-255-mm', '48255-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Makro•Grip® 5-Axis Vise is considered today\'s reference in 5-axus machining and guarantees workholding at the highest level. In combination with the stamping technology (external pre-stamping of the workpiece), even materials with huge tensile strength can be clamped extremely reliably and without wear on the clamping device. But even without pre-stamping, the 5-Axis Vise performs with maximum reliability. This version of the 5-Axis Vise with a jaw width of 125 mm has a maximum clamping range of 255 mm with the jaws reversed.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1700828456656095286a93e48255-125[1]_0 (1).webp', '[\"1700828456656095286abf148255-125_Seite_2 (1).webp\",\"1700828456656095286ad3e48255-125_Seite_1 (1).webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 15, '2023-11-24 19:20:56', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656442493af5a-prod-67613564171762485', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise', '48205-125-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise', '48205-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise with a jaw width of 125 mm and a clamping range of up to 205 mm offers maximum process reliability in 5-axis machining. Due to its compact design and low interference contours, the workpiece is ideally accessible for the tools used. Thanks to its form-fit clamping, it achieves maximum holding forces despite low clamping pressure. Even with high-tensile material, it is able to clamp workpieces without distortion. The gentle clamping also means that there is no wear on the 5-axis vise. This vise version can be used both in manual CNC machining and automated with the RoboTrex 96 automation system.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701069385656442493a9d848205-125[1]_0.webp', '[\"1701069385656442493acc048205-125_Seite_2.webp\",\"1701069385656442493adf348205-125_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 14, '2023-11-27 14:16:25', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656456c41f356-prod-49009735472223467', 'Center Jaws for Multiple Clamping', '48355-tg2527-lang-center-jaws-for-multiple-clamping', '48355-TG2527', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512ad0a4180c-ctgr-86285786990806497', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">If required, the Makro•Grip® 5-Axis Vice can be converted into a multiple clamping vice. During the conversion, which can be carried out in a few moments, only the set of spindle + centre piece from the 5-Axis Vice has to be replaced by the centre jaw + spindle.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701074628656456c41ef6948355-TG2527[1].webp', '[\"1701074628656456c41f1d448355-TG2527_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 22, '2023-11-27 15:43:48', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65645f24b2e05-prod-87477715938727335', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise', '48205-77-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise', '48205-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>This version of the Makro•Grip® 125 has a base body length of 210 mm and a width of 125 mm. The jaw width is 77 mm. The 5-Axis Vise is not only in great demand for manual CNC machining, but can also be used as an automation vise in the RoboTrex 96 automation system. Without an additional pallet, it is taken directly from the automation gripper and loaded into the machine tool. Thanks to its slim design, it requires very little space on the automation trolley, which ensures a high storage capacity on a small footprint.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170107677265645f24b289648205-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"170107677265645f24b2b3b48205-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"170107677265645f24b2c9448205-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, '2023-11-27 16:19:32', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6564613616ca4-prod-55210705743540306', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise', '48155-125-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise', '48155-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The shortest 5-axis vise with a jaw width of 125 mm has a maximum clamping range of 155 mm with a base body length of just 160 mm. Its compact design, the large clamping range compared to the base body and the good accessibility from all sides, offer excellent conditions for 5-axis machining of blanks. With its jaw serration, the vise holds pre-stamped blanks by form-fit. As a result, only very low pressure is required to clamp components with extreme hold and a high degree of safety. But even without pre-stamping, the 5-axis vise guarantees maximum hold at high cutting forces in raw part machining.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701077302656461361676148155-125[1]_0.webp', '[\"17010773026564613616a6948155-125_Seite_2.webp\",\"17010773026564613616b9148155-125_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13, '2023-11-27 16:28:22', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656462301d83a-prod-18708378022389618', 'Makro•Grip® 125, 5-Axis Vise', '48155-77-lang-makrogrip-125-5-axis-vise', '48155-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The most compact one among the „larger“ 5-axis vises from LANG Technik can realize a maximum clamping range of 155 mm using 77 mm clamping jaws. Like all Makro•Grip® 5-Axis Vises, it is equipped with four pull studs on its bottom side and is clamped directly in the Quick•Point® zero point clamping system. With its serrated clamping jaws, the centering vise holds the part by form-fit at a clamping depth of only 3 mm. Various additional surfaces also enable smooth clamping of the workpieces.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701077552656462301d19d48155-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"1701077552656462301d4d848155-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"1701077552656462301d68748155-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11, '2023-11-27 16:32:32', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540');
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `code`, `brand_id`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `price`, `show_price`, `show_price_to_partner`, `key_features`, `further_information`, `discount_type`, `discount`, `thumbnail`, `images`, `status`, `features`, `meta_title`, `meta_tags`, `meta_descriptions`, `ancestor_id`, `short_number`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `company_id`) VALUES
('65646338b5964-prod-58425531953800768', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48200-77-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48200-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>With a base body length of 210 mm, this vise version is the longest among the 5-Axis Vises with a base body width of 77 mm. Its jaw width is also 77 mm. The 5-Axis Vise made of case-hardened steel is extremely rigid and ideally suited for the challenges of 5-axis machining. The centering vise is equipped with clamping studs on its bottom for quick and highly accurate set up in the Quick-Point® zero point clamping system.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170107781665646338b54c448200-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"170107781665646338b56f348200-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"170107781665646338b584848200-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7, '2023-11-27 16:36:56', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656464b9a93ea-prod-80195495960136717', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48160-77-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48160-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The 5-axis vise from LANG Technik is characterized by its compact design and high holding forces. Its strengths come into full effect especially in the 5-axis machining of raw material. The 5-axis vise made of case-hardened steel and its clamping jaws milled from solid material easily endure even the highest strains in machining production. With its form-fit clamping technology, it ensures maximum safety in the machining process.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701078201656464b9a8e5648160-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"1701078201656464b9a911548160-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"1701078201656464b9a926f48160-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, '2023-11-27 16:43:21', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65646675e03c0-prod-21472396152195655', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48120-77-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48120-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The popular 5-axis vise with a clamping range of 0 - 120 mm and a jaw width of 77 mm is the ideal machine vise for 5-axis machining of unmachined parts. It is used both in manual milling and in automated production with RoboTrex. Workpieces are clamped by form-fit in the clamping jaws of the centering vise with a clamping depth of just 3 mm. Due to the centric clamping and the slim design, clamped workpieces are ideally accessible from all sides. On the side of the base body, it has an automation interface to be gripped directly by the robot\'s gripper.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170107864565646675dff5648120-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"170107864565646675e017b48120-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"170107864565646675e028c48120-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, '2023-11-27 16:50:45', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6564677c8589b-prod-24154163496166159', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48120-46-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48120-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The 5-Axis Vise with base body length 130 mm and jaw width 46 mm is extremely versatile. It is very popular in both manual and automated CNC machining. Due to the form-fit clamping principle, only low clamping pressures are required. Workpieces can therefore be clamped almost without deformation. There is no wear on the clamping device itself - even when high-tensile materials are clamped and machined. The constant clamping quality ensures high reliability in the machining process, which is particularly important in batch production with the RoboTrex automation system.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '17010789086564677c854df48120-46[1]_0.webp', '[\"17010789086564677c856b548120-46_Seite_2.webp\",\"17010789086564677c857a848120-46_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2023-11-27 16:55:08', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656469488ce8c-prod-64366745386870381', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48085-77-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48085-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The shortest version of the 5-axis vises with jaw width of 77 mm is suitable for smaller workpieces. By reversing the jaws, the vise achieves a maximum clamping range of 85 mm with a base body length of 102 mm. As with all Makro•Grip® 5-Axis Vises, workpieces are clamped centrically at a clamping depth of only 3 mm in the serration. Due to the defined, repeatable positioning of the component in the serration, no additional workpiece endstops are required. Thanks to its compact design and the low interference contours, the 5-Axis Vise is predestined for 5-sided machining.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701079368656469488c9ba48085-77[1]_0.webp', '[\"1701079368656469488cc0a48085-77_Seite_2.webp\",\"1701079368656469488cd5348085-77_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '2023-11-27 17:02:48', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65646be9d8afd-prod-72244178156270642', 'Makro•Grip® 77, 5-Axis Vise', '48085-46-lang-makrogrip-77-5-axis-vise', '48085-46', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p>The Makro•Grip® 5-axis vise is the ideal clamping device for the 5-axis machining of blank parts. Due to its compactness and low interference contours, it offers best accessibility to the workpiece. Thanks to the form-closure clamping principle, which requires only a low level of clamping pressure and can, therefore, be clamped without distortion or wear, it achieves the highest holding forces and guarantees maximum process reliability, even with high-tensile material.<br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170108004165646be9d866b48085-46[1]_0.webp', '[\"170108004165646be9d889e48085-46_Seite_2.webp\",\"170108004165646be9d89d348085-46_Seite_1.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2023-11-27 17:14:01', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65658248e1efe-prod-43791550686629248', 'Makro•Grip® 77, Contour Jaws', '48409-77-lang-makrogrip-77-contour-jaws', '48409-77', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acf34a86d-ctgr-29705123223230177', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the inside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the small clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170115130465658248e161c48409-77[1].webp', '[\"170115130465658248e186448160-77_48409-77 (1).webp\",\"170115130465658248e1a7548160-77_48409-77.webp\",\"170115130465658248e1c7448200-77_TG_48409-77.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20, '2023-11-28 13:01:44', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('656583894f9ba-prod-62400294689132788', 'Makro•Grip® 125, Contour Jaws', '48409-125-lang-makrogrip-125-contour-jaws', '48409-125', '1', '65115eaa217bc-ctgr-80906052148787198', '6512acf34a86d-ctgr-29705123223230177', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the inside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the small clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '1701151625656583894f1bd48409-125[1].webp', '[\"1701151625656583894f3f448409-125_Grundkoerper125_Mehrfach_Seite_1.webp\",\"1701151625656583894f54848409-125_Grundkoerper125_Seite_2.webp\",\"1701151625656583894f62248255-125_TG_48409-125.webp\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21, '2023-11-28 13:07:05', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6565c0383506c-prod-82094474373057335', 'Makro•Grip® 77, HAUBEX 5-Axis Vise', '61085-46-lang-makrogrip-77-haubex-5-axis-vise-2', '61085-46', '1', '65115ef3de69d-ctgr-19924755263429886', '65128a8d3c1d4-ctgr-79124670714864833', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">HAUBEX uses a modified version of the Makro•Grip® as the workholding device. The slim design of the 5-Axis Vice and the narrow jaw width of 46 mm ensure ideal accessibility in 5-sided machining of blanks. The maximum workpiece size of approx. 80 × 75 × 70 mm is given by the height and diameter of the workholding hood. Examples of possible dimensions and a formula for their calculation can be found on the data sheet in the downloads.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '17011671606565c0383443b61085-46.png', '[\"17011671606565c03834ae461085-46_Seite_3.jpg\",\"17011671606565c03834c9961085-46_Seite_2.jpg\",\"17011671606565c03834eaf61085-46_Seite_1.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 272, '2023-11-28 17:26:00', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6572b4aaef15d-prod-88923997028057065', 'THRU-HOLE POWER CHUCK 3-JAW', '3h3h-a-autogrip-thru-hole-power-chuck-3-jaw', '3H/3H-A', '653b40cbb988a-brnd-61212735378470921', '6572b24359595-ctgr-12814737465481327', '6572b2f7d878c-ctgr-19100409626695853', 1.00, 0, 0, '<div class=\"pro-desc\" style=\"height: auto;\">Thru-Hole | 3-JAW</div><ul><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">WEDGE-HOOK type 3-jaw with the large through-hole.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Matching surfaces of all parts hardened, ground and lubricated directly.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">High rigidity and high repeatability precision.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\">J is the hole diameter of blank draw nut.</li><li style=\"height: auto;\">If not notified, AUTOGRIP will adopt the K Default as K value.</li><li style=\"height: auto;\">K is the maximum thread specification and it could be customize.</li></ul>', '<font color=\"#2b2b2b\" face=\"Arial\"><b>power chank</b></font>', NULL, NULL, '17020161706572b4aaeef5c3h-3ha.jpg', '[\"1704738742659c3fb6480f83H3H-AProduct_page-0001.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 411, '2023-12-08 13:16:10', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('6576d65497f3f-prod-42278584952552023', 'ECO Series', 'eco-series-ar-filtrazioni-eco-series', 'ECO-Series', '653b4579b3e3b-brnd-38786264451941358', '6576d5a741b95-ctgr-63855707496093227', '6576d5c5704c2-ctgr-13292153389098652', 1.00, 0, 0, '<div class=\"title-header\" style=\"position: relative;\"><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 40px;\"></h2><h5 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px;\"><b>The ECO SERIES is suitable for the aspiration of fumes and oil mist</b></h5></div><div class=\"leader\" style=\"line-height: 30px; padding: 5px 0px 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px;\">A quality solution with a small size and price. This high quality, new generation COMPACT series by AR FILTRAZIONI is affordable and eco-friendly – and proud to be&nbsp;“Made in Italy”.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px;\">Our testing has given excellent results in applications in which the available space, machinery and amount of pollutant have made this a suitable solution.</p></div>', '<p>On sale for 15 years now, the&nbsp;ECO series&nbsp;is composed of two sub-series with air flow rates of 500 to 1100 m³/h. Thanks to its modular architecture, each unit is equipped with a high and very high efficiency filtration stage, EN 1822 compliant, and ensures filtration of up to 99.995% of particles &gt; 0.15 µ (note that the mean diameter of fumes particles is always &lt; 1 µ).<br></p>', NULL, NULL, '17022869326576d65497ad3ar-filtrazioni-serie-eco-depurazione-nebbie-oleose-macchine-utensili-3-removebg-preview.png', '[\"17022869326576d65497cefar-filtrazioni-serie-eco-depurazione-nebbie-oleose-macchine-utensili-4.jpg\",\"17022869326576d65497df8ar-filtrazioni-serie-eco-depurazione-nebbie-oleose-macchine-utensili-2.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, '', '<p><br></p>', NULL, 412, '2023-12-11 16:28:52', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
