style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Pin Field Dimension:</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">35.3 mm x 31 mm</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Total Dimension:</span></span><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;56 mm x 46 mm</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Total Height:</span></span><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;132 mm</span></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '17114709666602f97686743Pintec-FlexForm-Module-010.010-MTS.jpg', '[\"17114709666602f976868c3Pintec-FlexForm-Modules-010.010-MTS.jpg\",\"17114709666602f97686cdaPintec-FlexForm-Modules-Application-010.010-MTS.jpg\",\"171155418866043e8cc531bPintec-FlexFormModules-Application-010.010-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, '', '<p>Height: 45mm<br></p>', NULL, 318, '2023-12-12 11:33:17', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65aaa948ce6c2-prod-77168313302307535', 'Pintec power by Kostyrka', 'pintec-power-mold-clamping-system-pintec-pintec-power-by-kostyrka', 'Pintec Power Mold Clamping System', '653b40ed2bbbd-brnd-56085618647099342', '65aaba8fc0b16-ctgr-83259238588199759', '65a97fd6e999d-ctgr-41303796716617896', 1.00, 0, 0, '<h6><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 41, 41); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 20px;\"><b>Pintecpower - the form clamping system for quickly fixing workpieces of any geometry for machine processing.</b></span></h6><h6><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The pintec®power ram jaws allow the rapid and precise shaping of almost any workpiece contour.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">Shape-specific clamping jaws can be created within seconds.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">For this purpose, axially adjustable plungers rest against the workpiece contour and thus provide a positive connection to the workpiece. In this position, the plungers are then clamped hydraulically using the proven Kostyrka® clamping sleeves.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">A side effect of the resulting shaped element is a reduction in the clamping forces actually required due to a form-fitting component.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The pintec®power ram jaws open up a wide range of different possible uses, starting from the mechanical processing of free-form or cast parts, through prototypes to tasks in assembly.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The shaped elements can be used as top jaws for conventional vices, as support elements, in conjunction with robot grippers, in special solutions, etc.</font><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 41, 41); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 20px;\"><b><br></b></span></h6>', '<h1 uk-scrollspy-class=\"\" class=\"uk-scrollspy-inview\" style=\"margin: 40px 0px 20px; font-family: Roboto; color: rgb(41, 41, 41); font-size: 20px; line-height: 0;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 40px; margin-left: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><b>Unique benefits</b></font></p></h1><div class=\"uk-panel uk-margin uk-scrollspy-inview\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\" style=\"display: flow-root; position: relative; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 20px !important;\"><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-left: 30px;\"><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Customizable shape elements</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">No axial or radial displacement of the plungers when fixing</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Complete encapsulation prevents chips from entering</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Fully automatable</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Spans of any size</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Customized versions &nbsp;</font></li><li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Vibration minimization</font></li></ul></div>', NULL, NULL, '170809458665cf747a23f06Christian-Bewer-Pintec-Power-By-Kostyrka-MTS.jpg', '[\"170568878865aabed45bfc3pintecpower-1-8e57ad17.jpg\",\"170568878865aabed45c5cfpintecpower1-faf10b49.jpg\",\"170568878865aabed45c730pintecpower-2-0b65bfe3.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 359, '2024-01-19 23:54:32', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65b0056e4ce33-prod-87965777689919279', 'OK-Vise Smooth Jaw Clamp Model', 'bk2-vt-s-ok-vise-ok-vise-smooth-jaw-clamp-model', 'BK2-VT-S', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65b0031121793-ctgr-46549632573124533', 1.00, 0, 0, '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"\" lato\",sans-serif;=\"\" color:#121212;letter-spacing:-.4pt\"=\"\">The smooth jaw workholding clamps are\r\nspecifically engineered to securely hold your workpiece without leaving\r\nany&nbsp; visible marks or scratches.</span><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\" lato\",sans-serif;color:#121212;letter-spacing:-.4pt\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:\" lato\",sans-serif;=\"\" color:#121212;letter-spacing:-.4pt\"=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">OK-VISE’s&nbsp;</span>smooth jaw clamps remain a popular choice due to their low profile and\r\ndurability. Made with high-quality materials, the clamp is built to last,\r\nsaving you money and time. The clamp is easy to install and adjust, allowing\r\nyou to quickly and efficiently secure your workpiece with precision.</span></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170716313565c13dff3f8d6OK-Vise-Smooth-Jaw-Clamp-Model-BK2-VT-S-MTS.jpg', '[\"170716349265c13f641bfc6OK-Vise-Smooth-Jaw-Clamp-Model-Dimensions-BK2-VT-S-MTS.jpg\",\"170716352565c13f85ec4bdOK-Vise-Smooth-Jaw-BK2-VT-S-MTS.jpg\",\"170716352565c13f85ec64cOK-Vise-Smooth-Jaw-Clamp-BK2-VT-S-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL,