V-slot-crossed-model-DK2-VT-C-MTS.jpg', '[\"170749681065c6556ac7828OK-Vise-V-slot-crossed-model-Dimensions-DK2-VT-C-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 384, '2024-02-09 23:40:10', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65c6583ed20c6-prod-58332916229765290', 'OK-Vise V-Slot Crossed Model', 'dk2-vti-c-ok-vise-ok-vise-v-slot-crossed-model', 'DK2-VTI-C', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65c53449e5e82-ctgr-23304564638971201', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">This model is ideal for clamping rods, pins and disks.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">There are two V-slot options, one “vertically” (V) and one “horizontally” (H).<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Low-profile clamps with cross V-slot&nbsp;are used for machining of the cylindrical workpieces.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">The clamps enable workpieces to be placed in both the horizontal and vertical planes.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Please note: Combo-models with one smooth- and one V-slot jaw are available.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170749753465c6583ed1df9OK-Vise-V-slot-crossed-model-DK2-VTI-C-MTS.jpg', '[\"170749753465c6583ed1f70OK-Vise-V-slot-crossed-model-Dimensions-DK2-VTI-C-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 385, '2024-02-09 23:52:14', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65c689ace7a53-prod-51646324418297086', 'OK-Vise V-Slot Crossed Model', 'fk2-vt-c-ok-vise-ok-vise-v-slot-crossed-model', 'FK2-VT-C', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65c53449e5e82-ctgr-23304564638971201', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">This model is ideal for clamping rods, pins and disks.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">There are two V-slot options, one “vertically” (V) and one “horizontally” (H).<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Low-profile clamps with cross V-slot&nbsp;are used for machining of the cylindrical workpieces.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">The clamps enable workpieces to be placed in both the horizontal and vertical planes.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Please note: Combo-models with one smooth- and one V-slot jaw are available.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170751018865c689ace77f5OK-Vise-V-slot-crossed-model-FK2-VT-C-MTS.jpg', '[\"170751018865c689ace7946OK-Vise-V-slot-crossed-model-Dimensions-FK2-VT-C-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 386, '2024-02-10 03:23:08', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65ce717e35e77-prod-85145772690388379', 'OK-Vise Additional Piece Model', 'bk2-vt-t-ok-vise-ok-vise-additional-piece-model', 'BK2-VT-T', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65ce6531acf25-ctgr-72434781503101282', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The additional piece model is ideal for\r\nmachining short series, and/or when the shape of the workpiece changes\r\nfrequently.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Additional piece models have machined\r\nfemale threading (M5) for socket head screws on the side of the jaw face,\r\nmaking it quick and easy to use various additional pieces which can also be\r\nmachined into different shapes.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Additional pieces can be produced from\r\ndiffering materials such as plastic, aluminium or steel, depending on the\r\nworkpiece material.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">M5 thread length:<o:p></o:p></p><ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">B-size clamp = 4mm<o:p></o:p></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">D- and F-size clamps = 7mm</li></ul><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">N.B. There are also several sizes of\r\nadditional pieces available, generally they are made from aluminum but steel is\r\nalso an option.<font color=\"#121212\" face=\"Lato, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170810540965cf9ec158845OK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Model-BK2-VT-T-MTS.png', '[\"170810540965cf9ec1589d3OK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Model-Dimensions-BK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\",\"170810540965cf9ec158ab8OK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Clamp-Model-BK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\",\"170810540965cf9ec158bacOK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Clamp-Models-BK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 387, '2024-02-16 03:18:06', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65cf823d1735e-prod-65347324204236339', 'OK-Vise Additional Piece Model', 'dk2-vt-t-ok-vise-ok-vise-additional-piece-model', 'DK2-VT-T', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65ce6531acf25-ctgr-72434781503101282', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">The additional piece model is ideal for machining short series, and/or when the shape of the workpiece changes frequently.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Additional piece models have machined female threading (M5) for socket head screws on the side of the jaw face, making it quick and easy to use various additional pieces which can also be machined into different shapes.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">Additional pieces can be produced from differing materials such as plastic, aluminium or steel, depending on the workpiece material.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">M5 thread length:<o:p></o:p></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">B-size clamp = 4mm<o:p></o:p></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">D- and F-size clamps = 7mm</li></ul><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">N.B. There are also several sizes of additional pieces available, generally they are made from aluminum but steel is also an option.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170810525965cf9e2bb7fbbOK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Model-DK2-VT-T-MTS.png', '[\"170810525965cf9e2bb815eOK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Model-Dimensions-DK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\",\"170810525965cf9e2bb826aOK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Clamp-Model-DK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\",\"170810525965cf9e2bb8362OK-Vise-Additional-Piece-Clamp-Models-DK2-VT-T-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 388, '2024-02-16 22:41:49', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
