('65d4f207326b3-prod-76784565612365645', 'OK-Vise Single Wedge Pull Down Model', 'bk2-vt-pd-ok-vise-ok-vise-single-wedge-pull-down-model', 'BK2-VT-PD', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65d4e9e70f762-ctgr-48144618316831565', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Pull-down workholding clamps generate pull-down action, pressing workpieces down onto the fixture base, as an alternative to applying sideways force to the jaw on the fixture base.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The OK Vise single-wedge pull-down clamp design is a standard single-wedge clamp (inverted ) and combined with a pull-down set (a combination of a plate and a bushing).</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The major differences of single-wedge pull-down clamp when compared with double wedge pull-down clamps are :</p><ul style=\"margin-block: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><li style=\"margin-block: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">There are more variations of jaw types and clamp sizes.</li><li style=\"margin-block: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The angle of the movement is steeper.</li><li style=\"margin-block: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">It is easy to test fixture with and without pull-down property.</li></ul>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170845440765d4f20732263OK-Vise-Single-Wedge-Pull-Down-Model-BK2-VT-PD-MTS.jpg', '[\"170845440765d4f207323fdOK-Vise-Single-Wedge-Pull-Down-Serrated-Model-BK2-VT-PD-Dimension-MTS.jpg\",\"170845440765d4f20732566OK-Vise-Single-Wedge-Pull-Down-Serrated-Models-BK2-VT-PD-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 395, '2024-02-21 01:40:07', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
