('65d507d402693-prod-57855113194112347', 'OK-Vise Double Wedge Pull Down Model', 'dk2-wt-ok-vise-ok-vise-double-wedge-pull-down-model', 'DK2-WT', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65d5050305277-ctgr-88645933844153656', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Pull-down workholding clamps generate pull-down action pressing workpieces down onto the fixture base, as an alternative to applying sideways force to the jaw on the fixture base.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The double-wedge pull-down clamp is the most traditional model. It is available with both a serrated and smooth jaw option.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Whilst single-wedge clamps keep workpieces tight in one place, preventing upward and downward movement the double-wedge clamps generate a pull-down effect, pressing the workpieces downwards onto the fixture base.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The F-size model with its extreme clamping force of 150 kN is the strongest model in our range of low-profile clamps.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170852863465d613fabdcb2OK-Vise-Double-Wedge-Pull-Down-Model-DK2-WT-MTS.jpg', '[\"170852846865d61354a073fOK-Vise-Double-Wedge-Pull-Down-Model-DK2-WT-Dimension-MTS.jpg\",\"170852846865d61354a0886OK-Vise-Double-Wedge-Pull-Down-Models-DK2-WT-MTS.jpg\",\"170852846865d61354a0971OK-Vise-Double-Wedge-Pull-Down-Clamp-DK2-WT-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 399, '2024-02-21 03:13:08', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
