, '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
('65d76bee4fe6a-prod-10738213731860297', 'OK-Vise Self Adjustable Clamping Model', 'bk2-vt-e-ok-vise-ok-vise-self-adjustable-clamping-model', 'BK2-VT-E', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65d76309a3a5d-ctgr-26282139225629367', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Self-adjustable clamp model is a great option when the workpiece has irregular shapes.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">These&nbsp;clamps have a self-adjustable ball pressure screw inserted&nbsp;into a clamp jaw.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The ball bearing at the end is made of steel and&nbsp;equipped with torsion protection, allowing the ball to self-adjust up&nbsp;to 9 degrees. This makes clamping irregular-shaped parts and castings&nbsp;more flexible.</p><p style=\"margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Latest self-adjustable models (<font color=\"#121212\" face=\"Lato, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">-‘E’</span></font>) come with self-adjusting balls in both jaws.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170861782765d7706304332OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-Model-BK2-VT-E-MTS.jpg', '[\"170861684365d76c8b18b57OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-Model-BK2-VT-E-Dimension-MTS.jpg\",\"170861684365d76c8b18c9cOK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-Clamping-Model-BK2-VT-E-MTS.jpg\",\"170861684365d76c8b18df6OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-Clamp-Model-BK2-VT-E-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 405, '2024-02-22 22:44:46', '2024-05-17 20:40:58', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
