('65d783196c21f-prod-49347116694708942', 'OK-Vise Self Adjustable & Serrated Clamping Model', 'dk2-vt-b-ok-vise-ok-vise-self-adjustable-serrated-clamping-model', 'DK2-VT-B', '653b46614148c-brnd-14428085574324353', '6572a24b578c9-ctgr-53848849091679278', '65d76309a3a5d-ctgr-26282139225629367', NULL, 0, 0, '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Self-adjustable clamp model is a great option when the workpiece has irregular shapes.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">These&nbsp;clamps have a self-adjustable ball pressure screw inserted&nbsp;into a clamp jaw.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">The ball bearing at the end is made of steel and&nbsp;equipped with torsion protection, allowing the ball to self-adjust up&nbsp;to 9 degrees. This makes clamping irregular-shaped parts and castings&nbsp;more flexible.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-block: 0px 0.9rem;\">Latest self-adjustable models (<font color=\"#121212\" face=\"Lato, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">-‘E’</span></font>) come with self-adjusting balls in both jaws.</p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '170862261765d783196bd16OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-&-Serrated-Model-DK2-VT-B-MTS.jpg', '[\"170862261765d783196be88OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-&-Serrated-Model-DK2-VT-B-Dimension-MTS.jpg\",\"170862261765d783196bf79OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-&-Serrated-Clamping-Model-DK2-VT-B-MTS.jpg\",\"170862261765d783196c105OK-Vise-Self-Adjustable-&-Serrated-Clamp-Model-DK2-VT-B-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 409, '2024-02-23 00:23:37', '2024-0