rough a qualitative selection process of top grade high energy magnets and high dimensional tolerances between the stator and rotor we have achieved a 20% higher rated force in the same size. This allows us to offer the same size magnets with more lifting capacity.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Greater flexibility with thin gage loads:</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">PLM series magnets have been designed to meet the demand for handling thin loads in a safe and efficient way. The special design of the polar area together with a properly balanced magnetic field allows a lower flux depth. The properly balanced magnetic field allows for easier handle operation on thinner plates.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Reliability:</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">The on and off cycle is performed by simply turning a lever. The high tolerance bearing surface in the lifter is designed for years of service.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Permanently safe power:</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">High energy permanent magnets ensure great force and with good design we achieve concentrated power indefinitely. The 3X safety factor rating allows safe working conditions even with substantial air gaps.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Durable and compact Demag phase:</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">The incredible power to weight ratio is provided by the specific isolation design and high tolerance parts. Product innovation, material selection and state of the art&nbsp; manufacturing processes have created a powerful product with no maintenance requirements and convenient pricing resulting in great international success making PLM the best selling close proximity lifter on the market.</p>', NULL, NULL, '171094867565fb0143b4657BRISC-Permanent-Lifting-Magnet-PLM2000-MTS.jpg', '[\"171094867565fb0143b47f1BRISC-Permanent-Lifting-Magnet-PLM2000-Dimension-MTS.jpg\",\"171094867565fb0143b490cBRISC-Permanent-Lifting-Magnet-Graph-PLM2000-MTS.jpg\"]', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 303, '2024-03-20 22:31:15', '2024-05-13 21:17:20', '650293876e078-user-92625359878879540'),
