(68, 'App\\Models\\ProductPart', '646b5f28a0232-pprt-33629368432606135', 'en', 'key_features', 'Save expensive compressed air - use Clean-Tec! A \"must-have\" for automated manufacturing processes!\r\n\r\nGlass fibre compound body with steel centre core. Can be clamped in every common shank Ø20mm\r\nStrong and wear-resistend carbon fibre wings for best durability - even with tough chipping\r\nRigid retaining springs for a secure folding of blades after the cleaning process\r\nIdeal for cleaning workpieces prior to an automatic unloading. Workpieces and fixtures can be cleaned with coolant using the supply through the spindle. Clean-Tec is stored just like a&nbsp;', '2023-07-10 02:00:52', '2023-07-10 02:00:52'),
(69, 'App\\Models\\ProductPart', '646b5f28a0232-pprt-33629368432606135', 'en', 'further_information', 'Specific cleaning\r\nDesigned to clean surfaces of workholding or blowing out water pockets\r\nRotation from 6,000 - 12,000 RPM clockwise&nbsp;', '2023-07-10 02:00:52', '2023-07-10 02:00:52'),
