(112, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6501620fd2f02-prod-97591019282263667', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The new expandable Quick•Point® modular plates are characterized by even more simple, faster and user-friendly handling. The 1-fold modular plate is usually added to a 2-fold modular plate and connected to it via a connecting set. The patented clamping mechanism allows the connected modular plates to be actuated with just one tightening screw and clamping devices can be clamped in a cross-plate zero-point grid. The Quick•Point® modular plates are available without predefined mounting holes and can therefore be individually adapted to the conditions of the machine table. LANG offers the insertion of the necessary mounting holes as a service, but this can also be done by the customer.</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-position: inside; list-style-image: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border-style: initial; 