riation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Quick-Point is perfect for clamping the Makro-Grip System</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">The modular concept of our Quick-Point System allows to change quick and easy from 96 to 52 grid</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\"><b>Quick-Lock the fast actuation system</b></span>&nbsp;as optional accessory kit</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Easy adaptation of different clamping vices, fixtures or workpieces by separate available clamping studs</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit;\">Not only highly precise, but also providing high mechanical load capacity</span></li></ul>', '2023-09-13 01:17:35', '2023-09-13 01:17:35'),
