(137, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65019cb96714b-prod-67473350083385144', 'en', 'further_information', '<ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">For the best holding power, as well as the lowest wear on the vice is achieved with the stamping of the raw material! Please&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kitagawa.global/in/news/modular-work-holding-\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">click here</a>&nbsp;or see related products below for a detailed description and benefits of our patented Form-Closure technology.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;