(138, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65019e9c9cebc-prod-45974847776640044', 'en', 'name', 'Makro.Grip 5-Axis Vice 77 Centre Jaw and Spindle', '2023-09-13 18:35:56', '2023-09-13 18:35:56'),
(139, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65019e9c9cebc-prod-45974847776640044', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Compact and unmatched holding power for the 5-face-machining of blanks and unfinished parts.</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-position: inside; list-style-image: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">High Repeat Accuracy for inserting workpieces without any endstops.</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Rigid and sturdy base - but still lightweight and handy</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-