rit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">1x HAUBEX Nullpunkteinheit</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">1x&nbsp;45052-30: Cover Plugs, ø 16 mm, for 52 mm spacing</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">1x&nbsp;45000-30: Cover Plug Remover</li></ul></div></div></li></ul>', '2023-09-13 18:45:29', '2023-09-13 18:45:29'),
(147, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6501a236b2806-prod-72908144321968861', 'en', 'name', 'Vasto.Clamp 6-Jaw Chuck', '2023-09-13 18:51:18', '2023-09-13 18:51:18'),
(148, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6501a236b2806-prod-72908144321968861', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The Vasto·Clamp 6-Jaw Chuck has been engineered for clamping round parts as well. Vasto·Clamp uses a friction based clamping principle for clamping round material securely.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">With its six top jaws Vasto·Clamp can be used for clamping raw parts with two different hardened gripping jaws or with soft jaws for components sensitive to deformation.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The manually actuated scroll chuck can be flexibly used as 3- or 6-jaw chuck. The mounting and exchange of the jaws is realised&nbsp;without any tools by an innovative click mechanism, which provides a highly rigid and robust connection.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The Vasto·Clamp chuck is available with integrated&nbsp;0-point studs for our&nbsp;Quick-Point 96 zero-point&nbsp;clamping system, as well as<br>integrated interface for the LANG RoboTrex automation.</p>', '2023-09-13 18:51:18', '2023-09-13 18:51:18'),
