iant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://www.kitagawa.global/in/products/lang-products/workholding#categories%5B%5D=353&amp;f_makro_grip_ultra%5B%5D=Clamping+Jaws&amp;offset=0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Clamping jaws</a>&nbsp;are sold separately.</p><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 18\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"layoutArea\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"column\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Hexagon wrenches (size 5mm and 19mm) and a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kitagawa.global/in/products/lang-products/accessories/45000-30\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">cover plug remover</a>&nbsp;are included with every Base Set.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 19\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"layoutArea\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"column\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Depending on the desired clamping principle, you can choose between serrated Makro•Grip® Ultra clamping jaws, Avanti top jaws with plain clamping steps or conventional Avanti top jaws for shaped parts. Both types of Avanti jaws use the familiar dovetail technology. The serrated Makro•Grip® Ultra clamping jaws are milled from solid and are guided directly on the rails of the base body.</p></div></div></div><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Compact and unmatched holding power for the 5-face-machining of blanks and unfinished parts.</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-position: inside; list-style-image: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">High Repeat Accuracy for inserting workpieces without any endstops.</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Rigid and sturdy base - but still lightweight and handy</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Reversible jaws equipped with double-sided holding teeth contour (3mm or 5mm clamping height) and additional clamping support for non-stamped parts.</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Double guided jaws.</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Equipped with clamping studs for precise clamping in the 96 Quick.point zero-point clamping system.</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">To guarantee consistent actuation torque we recommend using a common torque wrench!</li></ul>', '2023-09-14 17:01:39', '2023-09-14 17:01:39'),
(152, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6502da0310b77-prod-38172722525938284', 'en', 'further_information', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">For the best holding power, as well as the lowest wear on the vice is achieved with the stamping of the raw material! Please&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kitagawa.global/in/products/lang-products/stamping-technology#categories%5B%5D=354&amp;offset=0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">click here</a>&nbsp;or see related products below for a detailed description and benefits of our patented Form-Closure technology.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Thanks to Form-Closure technology, workpieces can be securely clamped with low clamping pressure. Deformation and distortion of the material while clamping and releasing is impossible!&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">The reversible jaws are changed over with minimum downtime. A larger clamping range is achieved and interferences are eliminated.</p>', '2023-09-14 17:01:39', '2023-09-14 17:01:39'),
(153, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6502df41604e3-prod-34438709133105658', 'en', 'name', 'Avanti 77', '2023-09-14 17:24:01', '2023-09-14 17:24:01'),
(154, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6502df41604e3-prod-34438709133105658', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 13.8889px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">Makro-Grip Avanti - The universal vice with great handling characteristics and unbeatable add-on jaw prices!</p><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12.5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-position: inside; list-style-image: none;\"><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Enormous set-up time savings thanks to quick jaw exchange system</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">High repeat accuracy of clamping set-ups due to patented jaw exchange system</li><li style=\"font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-stretch: in