(232, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a94cb4fca-prod-43649400206378705', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 52, Automation System', '2023-09-26 16:50:04', '2023-09-26 16:50:04'),
(233, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a94cb4fca-prod-43649400206378705', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The RoboTrex 52 automation system, with a maximum storage capacity of 168 vises and workpiece weights of up to 12 kg, covers every need from single-part production to larger series. It is flexible, easy-to-use and offers an excellent cost-benefit ratio. It uses flexible automation trolleys as a storage for the vises, which can be pre-equipped off-line and enable rapid re-equipping of the system without machine downtime. Thanks to the intuitive operation and the pre-set system, no robotics knowledge is necessary, which keeps the training effort to a minimum and requires no specialised personnel.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:50:04', '2023-09-26 16:50:04'),
(234, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a94cb4fca-prod-43649400206378705', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:50:04', '2024-01-23 13:46:56'),
(235, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512a9d38f050-ctgr-52631995961863038', 'en', 'title', '5-Axis Vise', '2023-09-26 16:52:19', '2023-10-08 19:46:50'),
(236, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512a9ec8f78e-ctgr-43045760352422386', 'en', 'title', 'Spare Jaws', '2023-09-26 16:52:44', '2023-09-26 16:52:44'),
(237, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a9f583617-prod-61220542803544136', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 96, Automation System', '2023-09-26 16:52:53', '2023-09-26 16:52:53'),
(238, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a9f583617-prod-61220542803544136', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The RoboTrex 96 automation system with a maximum storage capacity of 64 vises and workpiece weights of up to 25 kg or 45 kg covers all needs, from single-part production to larger series. It is flexible, easy-to-use and offers an excellent cost-benefit ratio. It uses flexible automation trolleys as a storage for the vises, which can be pre-equipped off-line and enable rapid re-equipping of the system without machine downtime. The standard gripper exchange interface allows the use of all RoboTrex 52 Automation components. Thanks to the intuitive operation and the pre-set system, no robotics knowledge is necessary, which keeps the training effort to a minimum and requires no specialised personnel.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:52:53', '2023-09-26 16:52:53'),
(239, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512a9f583617-prod-61220542803544136', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:52:53', '2024-01-22 16:01:18'),
(240, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512aa097b307-ctgr-83281769888019877', 'en', 'title', 'Spare Parts', '2023-09-26 16:53:13', '2023-09-26 16:53:13'),
(241, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ab2ace166-prod-89332449319826019', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 52, Automation Trolley : storage capacity 42 spots', '2023-09-26 16:58:02', '2023-10-03 15:39:46'),
(242, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ab2ace166-prod-89332449319826019', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The RoboTrex 52 automation system’s automation trolley has a storage capacity of 42 vises, which are stored vertically, in order to be picked up by the robot. When fully loaded, the maximum workpiece size is 120 x 100 x 70 mm. For the use of higher or wider workpieces, individual vise positions or complete rows can be left free or deselected via the system’s control function. Thanks to its flexibility and mobility, the automation trolley can be pre-equipped off-line regardless of location.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:58:02', '2023-09-26 16:58:02'),
(243, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ab2ace166-prod-89332449319826019', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-09-26 16:58:02', '2024-01-23 13:47:45'),
(244, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512abbaab1ab-ctgr-61616792649181644', 'en', 'title', 'Stamping Units for workbench', '2023-09-26 17:00:26', '2023-09-26 17:00:26'),
(245, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512abc7c47f9-prod-31537002788820495', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 52, Automation Trolley :storage capacity 30 vises', '2023-09-26 17:00:39', '2023-12-04 20:32:51'),
(246, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512abc7c47f9-prod-31537002788820495', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The RoboTrex 52 automation system’s automation trolley has a storage capacity of 30 vises, which are stored vertically, in order to be picked up by the robot. When fully loaded, the maximum workpiece size is 120 x 120 x 100 mm. For the use of higher or wider workpieces, individual vise positions or complete rows can be left free or deselected via the system’s control function. Thanks to its flexibility and mobility, the automation trolley can be pre-equipped off-line regardless of location.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:00:39', '2023-09-26 17:00:39'),
(247, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512abc7c47f9-prod-31537002788820495', 'en', 'further_information', '<p>The RoboTrex 52 automation system’s automation trolley has a storage capacity of 30 vises, which are stored vertically, in order to be picked up by the robot. When fully loaded, the maximum workpiece size is 120 x 120 x 100 mm. For the use of higher or wider workpieces, individual vise positions or complete rows can be left free or deselected via the system’s control function. Thanks to its flexibility and mobility, the automation trolley can be pre-equipped off-line regardless of location.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:00:39', '2023-09-26 17:00:39'),
(248, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512abd2819a9-ctgr-23079404862406513', 'en', 'title', 'Stamping Unit on trolley', '2023-09-26 17:00:50', '2023-09-26 17:00:50'),
(249, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512abea406bf-ctgr-81427340654841132', 'en', 'title', 'Additional stamping vise', '2023-09-26 17:01:14', '2023-09-26 17:01:14'),
(250, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ac7a2a4eb-prod-96677000656745329', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 96, Automation Zero-Point Clamping System - Pneumatic', '2023-09-26 17:03:38', '2023-10-19 04:32:40'),
(251, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ac7a2a4eb-prod-96677000656745329', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The pneumatic zero-point clamping system for the RoboTrex 96 automation system is actuated via the pneumatic interface of the gripper on the robot or controlled by the machine tool. Like the Quick•Point® zero-point clamping system, it guarantees highly accurate positioning of the clamping devises with a repeat accuracy of &lt; 0.005 mm.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:03:38', '2023-09-26 17:03:38'),
(252, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ac7a2a4eb-prod-96677000656745329', 'en', 'further_information', '<p>The pneumatic zero-point clamping system for the RoboTrex 96 automation system is actuated via the pneumatic interface of the gripper on the robot or controlled by the machine tool. Like the Quick•Point® zero-point clamping system, it guarantees highly accurate positioning of the clamping devises with a repeat accuracy of &lt; 0.005 mm.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:03:38', '2023-09-26 17:03:38'),
(253, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512acdc57f6f-ctgr-60746026016934711', 'en', 'title', '5 - Axis Vise', '2023-09-26 17:05:16', '2024-03-19 00:54:56'),
(254, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6512acf34a86d-ctgr-29705123223230177', 'en', 'title', 'Spare Jaws2', '2023-09-26 17:05:39', '2023-10-03 14:09:02'),
(255, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ad0742087-prod-45033775142287641', 'en', 'name', 'RoboTrex 52, Automation Zero-Point Clamping System - Pneumatic', '2023-09-26 17:05:59', '2023-10-19 04:28:48'),
(256, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ad0742087-prod-45033775142287641', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The pneumatic zero-point clamping system for the RoboTrex 52 automation system is actuated via the pneumatic interface of the gripper on the robot or controlled by the machine tool. Thanks to the gripper exchange interface, it can also be used together with the other RoboTrex 52 components in the larger RoboTrex 96 automation system and is exchanged by its gripper.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:05:59', '2023-09-26 17:05:59'),
(257, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6512ad0742087-prod-45033775142287641', 'en', 'further_information', '<p>The pneumatic zero-point clamping system for the RoboTrex 52 automation system is actuated via the pneumatic interface of the gripper on the robot or controlled by the machine tool. Thanks to the gripper exchange interface, it can also be used together with the other RoboTrex 52 components in the larger RoboTrex 96 automation system and is exchanged by its gripper.<br></p>', '2023-09-26 17:05:59', '2023-09-26 17:05:59'),
