(609, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6528cf63e4cd3-ctgr-16950086490973703', 'en', 'title', 'Stamping Jaws', '2023-10-13 12:02:27', '2023-10-13 12:02:27'),
(610, 'App\\Models\\Category', '6528cf88457c2-ctgr-35340186630160422', 'en', 'title', 'Components', '2023-10-13 12:03:04', '2023-10-13 12:03:04'),
(611, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6528d17a44456-prod-25691863162994280', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip® Ultra, Stamping Unit', '2023-10-13 12:11:22', '2023-10-13 12:11:22'),
(612, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6528d17a44456-prod-25691863162994280', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This stamping unit is a variant of the stamping technology adapted to the system size of Makro•Grip® Ultra and can stamp parts up to a length of 420 mm. The system is designed as a double stamping unit with two stamping system bases that can be flexibly offset in 96 mm increments on the slot plate. Matching the clamping jaws, the stamping unit is supplied with parallels for a workpiece clamping depth of 3 mm and 5 mm.</p>', '2023-10-13 12:11:22', '2023-10-13 12:11:22'),
(613, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6528d17a44456-prod-25691863162994280', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-13 12:11:22', '2023-10-13 12:11:22'),
(623, 'App\\Models\\Category', '652986b6b4d77-ctgr-25151634211269872', 'en', 'title', '6-Jaw Chuck', '2023-10-14 01:04:38', '2023-10-14 01:04:38'),
(624, 'App\\Models\\Category', '652986f54be15-ctgr-29393427636531251', 'en', 'title', 'Top Jaws vasto', '2023-10-14 01:05:41', '2023-10-14 01:05:41'),
(625, 'App\\Models\\Category', '652987193828c-ctgr-39761950800154751', 'en', 'title', 'Base Jaws vasto', '2023-10-14 01:06:17', '2023-10-14 01:06:17'),
(626, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65298813079fb-prod-40805144401152127', 'en', 'name', 'Vasto•Clamp 96, 6-Jaw Chuck', '2023-10-14 01:10:27', '2023-10-14 01:10:27'),
(627, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65298813079fb-prod-40805144401152127', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The 6-jaw chuck with quick jaw exchange system is equally suitable for machining blank parts with gripping jaws and for the clamping of deformation-sensitive components with soft top jaws. In both cases, the manually operated scroll chuck utilises a friction based clamping principle. The mounting of the top jaws is done completely without additional tools thanks to an innovative click mechanism.</p>', '2023-10-14 01:10:27', '2023-10-14 01:10:27'),
(628, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65298813079fb-prod-40805144401152127', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-14 01:10:27', '2023-10-14 01:10:27'),
(629, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6529881e04143-prod-39881850667347076', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point®, Adaptor Plate', '2023-10-14 01:10:38', '2023-10-14 01:10:38'),
(630, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6529881e04143-prod-39881850667347076', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The adapter plate represents the modularity and versatility of the zero point clamping system. It can be used to switch from the large 96 mm grid dimension to the small 52 mm grid dimension if the user has not only large but also small clamping devices in use. In this case, the adapter plate improves accessibility when machining small components due to the raised position of the clamping device.<br></p>', '2023-10-14 01:10:38', '2023-10-14 01:10:38'),
(631, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6529881e04143-prod-39881850667347076', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-14 01:10:38', '2023-10-14 01:10:38'),
(644, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652990997a1ce-prod-51360463095296848', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point®, Adaptor Plate', '2023-10-14 01:46:49', '2023-10-14 01:46:49'),
(645, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652990997a1ce-prod-51360463095296848', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The receiver plate emphasizes the modularity and versatility of the zero-point clamping system. This facilitates the change from the large 96 mm grid size to the small 52 mm grid size if the user has not only large but also small clamping devises in use. Here, and thanks to the raised position of the clamping device, the receiver plate improves accessibility when machining small components.<br></p>', '2023-10-14 01:46:49', '2023-10-14 01:46:49'),
(646, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652990997a1ce-prod-51360463095296848', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-14 01:46:49', '2023-10-14 01:46:49'),
(659, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652996c453e83-prod-75183695099399031', 'en', 'name', 'Vasto•Clamp 96, Base Jaw Set', '2023-10-14 02:13:08', '2023-10-14 02:13:08'),
