(691, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6529a8289782c-prod-36025508342295125', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>The clamping edge of this combo zero-point plate allows mounting on basically all machine tables if clamps are used for this purpose. Due to its simple mounting, this plate version is also often used as an interface on pallet automations or on own customer-specific clamping devices. Due to the two grid sizes 52 mm and 96 mm, all vise sizes from LANG Technik can be used in this combo plate.<br></p>', '2023-10-14 03:27:20', '2023-10-14 03:27:20'),
