(828, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652a554dc5dfe-prod-14517843557017957', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Profilo vise with its separately available top jaws is a flexible clamping solution for profile and pre-machined parts. The soft, individually machinable top jaws of the Profilo, which are positioned on the base jaws via feather keys and mounted from below with four screws each, are available in steel and aluminium, but can also be manufactured in-house.</p>', '2023-10-14 15:46:05', '2023-10-14 15:46:05'),
