stop for the central, repeatable insertion of the blanks.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:14:21', '2023-10-19 04:51:05'),
(1333, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652edd0d6a2c2-prod-65469503937315537', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:14:21', '2023-10-17 19:14:21'),
(1334, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ede5141437-prod-72109245354008762', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit - Standard, with standard stamping jaws', '2023-10-17 19:19:45', '2023-10-19 04:51:43'),
(1335, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ede5141437-prod-72109245354008762', 'en', 'key_features', '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The standard stamping unit for the workbench is equipped with standard stamping jaws for materials up to 35 HRC. In this version, workpiece blanks up to 245 mm clamping length can be stamped. Quick adjustment of the clamping length is possible as soon as the two locking pins are removed from the system body. Fine adjustment to the corresponding workpiece width is made via a spindle. An adjusting wheel on the hydraulic housing of the stamping unit trolley is used to set the stamping pressure continuously up to a maximum of 360 bar. The stamping process is triggered by a pneumatic pedal that can be operated by hand or foot. The scope of delivery includes a protective shield and a scaled end stop for the central, repeatable insertion of the blanks.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:19:45', '2023-10-19 04:51:43'),
(1336, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ede5141437-prod-72109245354008762', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:19:45', '2023-10-17 19:19:45'),
(1337, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee0a198ea6-prod-42721596564215193', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:29:37', '2023-10-17 19:29:37'),
(1338, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee0a198ea6-prod-42721596564215193', 'en', 'key_features', '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The dual-stamping unit trolley is used to stamp wide workpieces, which are then held in two Makro•Grip® 5-axis vises. The position of the two stamping unit trolley system bodies can be individually adjusted via the marking holes or plate slots so that the position of the two stampings in the workpiece corresponds to the position of the serrated Makro•Grip® vise jaws. The two stamping unit bodies allow a maximum stamping width of up to 355 mm and stamping of material up to 45 HRC hardness.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:29:37', '2023-10-17 19:35:44'),
(1339, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee0a198ea6-prod-42721596564215193', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:29:37', '2023-10-17 19:29:37'),
(1340, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee1e96b961-prod-19750524397990313', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:35:05', '2023-10-17 19:35:05'),
(1341, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee1e96b961-prod-19750524397990313', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The dual-stamping unit trolley is used to stamp wide workpieces, which are then held in two Makro•Grip® 5-axis vises. The position of the two stamping unit trolley system bodies can be individually adjusted via the marking holes or plate slots so that the position of the two stampings in the workpiece corresponds to the position of the serrated Makro•Grip® vise jaws. The two stamping unit bodies allow a maximum stamping width of up to 355 mm and stamping of material up to 35 HRC hardness.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:35:05', '2023-10-17 19:35:05'),
(1342, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee1e96b961-prod-19750524397990313', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:35:05', '2023-10-17 19:35:05'),
(1343, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee3408c710-prod-54825108412684221', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:40:48', '2023-10-17 19:40:48'),
(1344, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee3408c710-prod-54825108412684221', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. This stamping unit trolley is equipped with a slot plate on which an extended stamping unit body with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and High-End stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 45 HRC is mounted. Via the plate slots, the system body can either be moved freely or offset in a defined way via marking holes. Retrofitting an additional stamping unit trolley for dual-stamping is also possible.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:40:48', '2023-10-17 19:40:48'),
(1345, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee3408c710-prod-54825108412684221', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:40:48', '2023-10-17 19:40:48'),
(1346, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee49e52ab8-prod-62152849553622798', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:46:38', '2023-10-17 19:46:38'),
(1347, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee49e52ab8-prod-62152849553622798', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. This stamping unit trolley is equipped with a slot plate on which an extended stamping unit body with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and standard stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 35 HRC is mounted. Via the plate slots, the system body can either be moved freely or offset in a defined way via marking holes. Retrofitting an additional stamping unit trolley for dual-stamping is also possible.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:46:38', '2023-10-17 19:46:38'),
(1348, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee49e52ab8-prod-62152849553622798', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:46:38', '2023-10-17 19:46:38'),
(1349, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee5fb0220b-prod-90051879774319782', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:52:27', '2023-10-17 19:52:27'),
(1350, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee5fb0220b-prod-90051879774319782', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. The system body of the mobile stamping unit trolley in its standard version with a stamping width of up to 245 mm and High-End stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 45 HRC is mounted directly on the stamping unit trolley. The pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier is mounted inside the stamping unit trolley. To the left and right of the system body, the operator has sufficient space and storage area, for example, to set up vises with the stamped blanks.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:52:27', '2023-10-17 19:52:27'),
(1351, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee5fb0220b-prod-90051879774319782', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:52:27', '2023-10-17 19:52:27'),
(1352, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee71d37cf6-prod-54448667974062055', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Trolley', '2023-10-17 19:57:17', '2023-10-17 19:57:17'),
(1353, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee71d37cf6-prod-54448667974062055', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">With the mobile stamping unit trolley, you decide where you want to stamp your raw material and are thus flexible as far as the place of use is concerned. The system body of the mobile stamping unit trolley in its standard version with a stamping width of up to 245 mm and stamping jaws with a material hardness of up to 35 HRC is mounted directly on the stamping unit trolley. The pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier is mounted inside the stamping unit trolley. To the left and right of the system body, the operator has sufficient space and storage area, for example, to set up vises with the stamped blanks.</p>', '2023-10-17 19:57:17', '2023-10-17 19:57:17'),
(1354, 'App\\Models\\Product', '652ee71d37cf6-prod-54448667974062055', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-17 19:57:17', '2023-10-17 19:57:17'),
(1355, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653054fedcc36-prod-47129558915612655', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point® Rail, Clamping bar', '2023-10-18 21:58:22', '2023-10-18 21:58:22'),
(1356, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653054fedcc36-prod-47129558915612655', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Quick•Point® Rail is an innovative clamping system that allows zero point risers and 5-Axis Vises to be attached quickly. Here, the clamping bar is inserted directly into the groove of the machine table or mounted on an automation pallet - without having to make any changes to the base. The single clamping bar can also be extended with extension bars if more than two clamping elements are to be clamped next to each other. This version of the clamping bar has no mounting holes as standard and can be adapted to a possible hole pattern of the base, depending on requirements.</p>', '2023-10-18 21:58:22', '2023-10-18 21:58:22'),
(1357, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653054fedcc36-prod-47129558915612655', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-18 21:58:22', '2023-10-18 21:58:22'),
(1358, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653056687123b-prod-42001812749848186', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point® Rail, Clamping bar', '2023-10-18 22:04:24', '2023-10-18 22:04:24'),
(1359, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653056687123b-prod-42001812749848186', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Quick•Point® Rail is a quick clamping system for holding zero point risers and 5-Axis Vises. Here, the clamping bar is inserted directly into the groove of the machine table or attached to an automation pallet without any modification of the base. The clamping bar can be used either individually or in combination with extension bars if more than two clamping devices are to be used side by side. With its holes spaced 50 mm apart, it can be mounted on pallets with exactly this hole pattern or fixed in the machine table using sliding blocks.</p>', '2023-10-18 22:04:24', '2023-10-18 22:04:24'),
(1360, 'App\\Models\\Product', '653056687123b-prod-42001812749848186', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-18 22:04:24', '2023-10-18 22:04:24'),
(1361, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530583812e39-prod-49069067169882662', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point® Rail 52/96, 5-Axis Combi Riser', '2023-10-18 22:12:08', '2023-10-18 22:12:08'),
(1362, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530583812e39-prod-49069067169882662', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The 5-axis combi riser from Quick•Point® Rail can be mounted on the clamping bars of the quick clamping system with absolute flexibility and positioning accuracy. Thanks to the dovetail guide and the pull-down principle, the interface between the clamping bar and the riser is extremely stable and resilient - a guarantee for reliable and consistent milling quality. With the two zero point grids - 52 and 96 mm - all vise versions from LANG can be clamped without any problems. The overall height of 100 mm makes this riser ideal for 5-axis machining, where good accessibility is required.</p>', '2023-10-18 22:12:08', '2023-10-18 22:12:08'),
(1363, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530583812e39-prod-49069067169882662', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-18 22:12:08', '2023-10-18 22:12:08'),
(1364, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530595cbe781-prod-41035186461092254', 'en', 'name', 'Quick•Point® Rail 52/96, 5-Axis Combi Riser', '2023-10-18 22:17:00', '2023-10-18 22:17:00'),
(1365, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530595cbe781-prod-41035186461092254', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Quick•Point® Rail 5-axis combi riser can be flexibly positioned on the clamping and extension bars of the quick clamping system and fixed at 4 mm intervals. Thanks to the dovetail guide and pull-down effect, the quick clamping system impresses with maximum stability and load capacity. The 5-axis combi riser offers both the 52 mm and the 96 mm zero point grid on its upper side, which means that any vise model from LANG can be clamped in it.</p>', '2023-10-18 22:17:00', '2023-10-18 22:17:00'),
(1366, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530595cbe781-prod-41035186461092254', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-18 22:17:00', '2023-10-18 22:17:00'),
(1367, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65305aa8be414-prod-23571974632809999', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip® FS Rail 125, 5-Axis Vise', '2023-10-18 22:22:32', '2023-10-18 22:22:32'),
(1368, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65305aa8be414-prod-23571974632809999', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The Makro•Grip® 125 Rail 5-Axis Vise has a jaw width of 125 mm and holds workpieces up to 205 mm clamping range. The 5-Axis Vise can be mounted on the clamping bars of the quick clamping system with absolute flexibility and positional accuracy at 4 mm intervals. Thanks to the dovetail guide and the pull-down principle, the connection between the clamping bar and the vise is extremely robust. The quick clamping system defies even the highest cutting forces and thus proves its extraordinary stability and load capacity. The overall height of the vise of 116 mm creates sufficient distance to the machine table or the automation pallet and thus guarantees best accessibility in milling operations.</p>', '2023-10-18 22:22:32', '2023-10-18 22:22:32'),
(1369, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65305aa8be414-prod-23571974632809999', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-18 22:22:32', '2023-10-18 22:22:32'),
(1370, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bdf6776b2-prod-52124763251970254', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit', '2023-10-19 05:26:14', '2023-10-19 05:26:14'),
(1371, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bdf6776b2-prod-52124763251970254', 'en', 'key_features', '<p></p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: \" encode=\"\" sans=\"\" compressed\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 20px;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" normal;=\"\" font-variant-ligatures:=\"\" font-variant-caps:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" 400;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.8px;=\"\" orphans:=\"\" 2;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" left;=\"\" text-indent:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" none;=\"\" widows:=\"\" word-spacing:=\"\" -webkit-text-stroke-width:=\"\" white-space:=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(247,=\"\" 247,=\"\" 248);=\"\" text-decoration-thickness:=\"\" initial;=\"\" text-decoration-style:=\"\" text-decoration-color:=\"\" initial;\"=\"\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div><p></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The extended, additional stamping unit with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and High-End stamping jaws up to 45 HRC material hardness is used to convert a single stamping unit into a dual-stamping unit. The scope of delivery for the additional stamping unit, which is supplied without the pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier, includes the mounting material for the additional stamping unit.</p>', '2023-10-19 05:26:14', '2023-10-20 17:31:23'),
(1372, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bdf6776b2-prod-52124763251970254', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-19 05:26:14', '2023-10-19 05:26:14'),
(1373, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bf016d629-prod-96259418940811676', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip®, Stamping Unit', '2023-10-19 05:30:41', '2023-10-19 05:30:41'),
(1374, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bf016d629-prod-96259418940811676', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The extended, additional stamping unit with a stamping width of up to 355 mm and standard stamping jaws up to 35 HRC material hardness is used to convert a single stamping unit into a dual-stamping unit. The scope of delivery for the additional stamping unit, which is supplied without the pneumatic-hydraulic pressure multiplier, includes the mounting material for the additional stamping unit.</p>', '2023-10-19 05:30:41', '2023-10-19 05:30:41'),
(1375, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530bf016d629-prod-96259418940811676', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-19 05:30:41', '2023-10-19 05:30:41'),
(1379, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c12bea87c-prod-10172395803181663', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip® 77, Contour Jaws', '2023-10-19 05:39:55', '2023-10-19 05:39:55'),
(1380, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c12bea87c-prod-10172395803181663', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the outside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the large clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '2023-10-19 05:39:55', '2023-10-19 05:39:55'),
(1381, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c12bea87c-prod-10172395803181663', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-19 05:39:55', '2023-10-19 05:39:55'),
(1382, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c2e02008f-prod-17888163518210527', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip® 125, Contour Jaws', '2023-10-19 05:47:12', '2023-10-19 05:47:12'),
(1383, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c2e02008f-prod-17888163518210527', 'en', 'key_features', '<p><div class=\"product-attributes__data-list\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; color: rgb(87, 87, 86); font-family: &quot;Encode Sans Compressed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.8px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><div class=\"data__item\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; border-bottom: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; gap: 7px; font-size: 1rem;\"></div></div></p><p class=\"product__text\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 36px; z-index: 1; position: relative; grid-column: 1 / 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">LANG Technik is expanding its clamping jaw range for the Makro-Grip® 5-Axis Vice with a new variant of its popular contour jaws for clamping profile and pre-machined parts. The special feature is the attachment of the contour jaws to the clamping jaws of the 5-Axis Vice without changing jaws or tools, which guarantees a very simple and fast set-up process. By form-fit the contour jaws engage in the Makro-Grip® serration and hold them in position. The contour jaws are attracted to the clamping jaws via magnets. This type of jaw is suitable for the outside of the clamping jaws and is intended for the large clamping range, so to speak.</p>', '2023-10-19 05:47:12', '2023-10-19 05:47:12'),
(1384, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530c2e02008f-prod-17888163518210527', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-19 05:47:12', '2023-10-19 05:47:12'),
(1385, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530d8d58fbc7-prod-20615453427683769', 'en', 'name', 'Makro•Grip® micro 46, 5-Axis Vise Jaw width 46 mm, Clamping range 0 - 65 mm', '2023-10-19 07:20:53', '2023-10-19 07:20:53'),
(1386, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530d8d58fbc7-prod-20615453427683769', 'en', 'key_features', '<p>Rarely has \"small but mighty\" been so appropriate as with the new Makro•Grip® 46 micro. The 5-Axis Vise with jaw width 46 mm and clamping range up to a maximum of 65 mm is ideally suited for machining small components where space is limited. Its special feature is on the underside of the vise. Instead of four clamping studs, only two clamping studs are installed in this version. This makes it possible to clamp two of these vises in one Quick•Point® 52 zero point plate. Likewise, the new micro vise can be used on the matching Quick•Point® duo series - either alone or side by side, depending on the type of the plate.<br></p>', '2023-10-19 07:20:53', '2023-10-19 07:20:53'),
(1387, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6530d8d58fbc7-prod-20615453427683769', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2023-10-19 07:20:53', '2024-01-23 13:15:14'),
