(1713, 'App\\Models\\Product', '6572b4aaef15d-prod-88923997028057065', 'en', 'key_features', '<div class=\"pro-desc\" style=\"height: auto;\">Thru-Hole | 3-JAW</div><ul><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">WEDGE-HOOK type 3-jaw with the large through-hole.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Matching surfaces of all parts hardened, ground and lubricated directly.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\"><span style=\"background-color: var(--bs-modal-bg); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">High rigidity and high repeatability precision.</span></li><li style=\"height: auto;\">J is the hole diameter of blank draw nut.</li><li style=\"height: auto;\">If not notified, AUTOGRIP will adopt the K Default as K value.</li><li style=\"height: auto;\">K is the maximum thread specification and it could be customize.</li></ul>', '2023-12-08 13:16:10', '2023-12-08 13:17:52'),
