(2194, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65bd1728b2804-prod-64819139745775862', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">When you need to have a customized jaw that\r\nfits exactly to your workpiece we recommend our machinable jaw model.&nbsp;<br>These clamps are available with extended\r\njaws and can be machined to suit the geometry of the workpiece. The smallest\r\nmodel can be machined up to 3 mm and the larger ones up to 5 mm:</p><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">B-size clamp = 3 mm</li></ul><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">D- and F-size clamps = 5 mm</li></ul>One popular variation of these is a model\r\nwith one machinable jaw. Then the other jaw is typically smooth ( +3S, +5S )<p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>', '2024-02-02 23:24:08', '2024-02-02 23:24:52'),
