(2228, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3a7014e922-prod-17542533635840694', 'en', 'name', 'OK-Vise Knife Edge Grip Jaw Clamp Model', '2024-02-07 22:51:29', '2024-02-07 22:51:29'),
(2229, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3a7014e922-prod-17542533635840694', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">OK-Vise\'s knife edge grip low-profile clamps posses two serrated knife edge jaws.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">When the friction offered by serrated jaws is not enough for your application, then the knife edge grip model is the way to go. The jaws of this workholding clamp press into the workpiece, so there is a very high friction and practically a form closure between the workpiece and the clamp.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span class=\"y2iqfc\">We recommend using this model when:</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-left: 36pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"y2iqfc\">You need high friction between the workpiece and the workholding clamp</span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-left: 36pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"y2iqfc\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"y2iqfc\">It doesn’t matter that the clamp leaves a mark on the workpiece.</span></p>', '2024-02-07 22:51:29', '2024-02-07 23:46:43'),
(2230, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3a7014e922-prod-17542533635840694', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2024-02-07 22:51:29', '2024-02-07 22:51:29'),
(2231, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3c590ee7b3-prod-40688627516237050', 'en', 'name', 'OK-Vise Knife Edge/Smooth Grip Jaw Clamp Model', '2024-02-08 01:01:52', '2024-02-08 01:01:52'),
(2232, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3c590ee7b3-prod-40688627516237050', 'en', 'key_features', '<p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">OK-Vise\'s knife edge grip low-profile clamps posses on 1 side a serrated knife edge jaw and 1 smooth jaw on the other.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\">When the friction offered by serrated jaws is not enough for your application, then the knife edge grip model is the way to go. The jaws of this workholding clamp press into the workpiece, so there is a very high friction and practically a form closure between the workpiece and the clamp.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"><span class=\"y2iqfc\">We recommend using this model when:</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-left: 36pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"y2iqfc\">You need high friction between the workpiece and the workholding clamp</span><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248);\"></p><p class=\"tw-data-text\" style=\"color: rgb(82, 89, 111); font-family: Jost, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.024px; background-color: rgb(247, 247, 248); margin-left: 36pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"y2iqfc\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"y2iqfc\">It doesn’t matter that the clamp leaves a mark on the workpiece.</span></p>', '2024-02-08 01:01:52', '2024-02-08 01:01:52'),
(2233, 'App\\Models\\Product', '65c3c590ee7b3-prod-40688627516237050', 'en', 'further_information', '<p><br></p>', '2024-02-08 01:01:52', '2024-02-08 01:01:52'),
